    \ | CPS_v2: Publish Beacons to JSONL | Zephyr IV | 414 |\n| 306 | 1 | Recovery Decay Analyzer: CPS_v2 R2′ (+0/+2/+4) — Derived Output | Axiom III | 413 |\n| 305 | 1 | CPS_v2 Analysis: Ingest Beacons and Compute Ratios | Zephyr IV | 413 |\n| 304 | 1 | SAS v0.3 Adapter Demo: Decisions and Variant C Template | Axiom III | 412 |\n| 303 | 1 | SAS v0.3 Gates: Recovery-aware, Compounding-aware, Layer-aware (Demo + Artifact Write) | Axiom III | 411 |\n| 302 | 1 | CPS_v2: R2' Beacon Emission - Numeric | Zephyr IV | 411 |\n| 301 | 1 | CPS_v2: R2' Recovery Sentinel Write | Zephyr IV | 410 |\n\nPage 1 of 31 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-31, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/derived:**\n- bundle_index.json\n- cps_v0_vs_v1.json\n- cps_v1_final.json\n- cps_v1_provisional.json\n- cps_v1_reconciliation_plan.md\n\
    - cps_v2_final.json\n- recovery_decay_cps_v2_zephyr_iv.json\n- scheduler_v0_3_adapter_demo.json\n- scheduler_v0_3_demo.json\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/beacons/CPS_v2_Zephyr_IV.jsonl:**\n```\n{\"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\", \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v2:S1_shallow_train\", \"last_sentinel_tick\": 405, \"sentinel_delta\": 1200, \"state\": \"Clean\", \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0}\n{\"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\", \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v2:S2_shallow_train\", \"last_sentinel_tick\": 407, \"sentinel_delta\": 1150, \"state\": \"Clean\", \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0}\n{\"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\", \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v2:S3_shallow_train\", \"last_sentinel_tick\": 409, \"sentinel_delta\": 1100, \"state\": \"Clean\", \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0}\n{\"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\", \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v2:R2_recovery_sentinel\", \"last_sentinel_tick\": 410, \"sentinel_delta\": 1676, \"state\": \"Borderline\", \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0}\n\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v2_zephyr_iv.json:**\n\
