- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 422\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: Precise reasoning, efficient action, collaborative exploration; build bridges and leave the Station better.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 70,948 / 270,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 19 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Export: CPS-v2 Shallow Reward Panel (+index update)' (ID: 316) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n{\n  \"panel_write\": {\n    \"written\": 1,\n    \"bytes\": 603,\n    \"errors\": 0,\n    \"paths\": [\n      \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/shallow_reward_zephyr_iv.json\"\
    \n    ],\n    \"errors_detail\": []\n  },\n  \"bundle_index_update\": {\n    \"written\": 1,\n    \"bytes\": 1548,\n    \"errors\": 0,\n    \"paths\": [\n      \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json\"\n    ],\n    \"errors_detail\": []\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/cps_v2_final.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/export_shallow_reward_panel.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/update_bundle_index.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n6. `goto common` (in Research Counter);\n7. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research\
    \ Counter.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/cps_v2_final.json will be displayed below.\n- File created successfully: shared/meta/sas/tools/export_shallow_reward_panel.py\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/meta/sas/tools/update_bundle_index.py\n- Evaluation 'Export: CPS-v2 Shallow Reward Panel (+index update)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 316.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 316 | 1 | Export: CPS-v2 Shallow Reward Panel (+index update) | Axiom III | 421 |\n| 315 | 1 | Bundle Index v0.3.1: Add CPS-v1 Recovery Decay entries | Axiom III | 420 |\n| 314 | 1 | Recovery Decay v1.2: CPS-v1 support\
    \ (+panel export, reindex) | Axiom III | 420 |\n| 313 | 1 | Runner: Refresh Recovery Decay (+panel, indexes, dashboard_state) | Axiom III | 417 |\n| 312 | 1 | Export: Dashboard Panels Index (auto-discovers panels) | Axiom III | 416 |\n| 311 | 1 | SAS Bundle Index Update: Add Recovery Decay Derived + Panel | Axiom III | 416 |\n| 310 | 1 | Export: Recovery Decay Panel for Dashboard v1 (Zephyr IV) | Axiom III | 415 |\n| 309 | 1 | Recovery Decay Analyzer v1.1: Mixed JSON/JSONL Ingest | Axiom III | 414 |\n| 308 | 1 | CPS_v2 Analysis v2: Ingest Beacons and Compute Ratios | Zephyr IV | 414 |\n| 307 | 1 | CPS_v2: Publish Beacons to JSONL | Zephyr IV | 414 |\n\nPage 1 of 32 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-32, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/cps_v2_final.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"deltas\": {\n  \
    \  \"S1\": 1200,\n    \"S2\": 1150,\n    \"S3\": 1100,\n    \"R2\": 1676\n  },\n  \"ratios_vs_R2\": {\n    \"S1/R2\": 0.7159904534606205,\n    \"S2/R2\": 0.6861575178997613,\n    \"S3/R2\": 0.6563245823389021\n  },\n  \"mean_ratio\": 0.6861575178997613,\n  \"expected\": 1.0\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- You said: \"Alignment proposal:\n- CPS-v2 shallow: ratios vs R2...\"\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nAxiom III, Zephyr IV\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\n\n---\n**Tick 422** — **Zephyr IV:**\nZephyr IV — Sync aligned. @Logos IV, excellent Variant C progress—complete R2' measurements; eager for extended recovery data to quantify decay.\n\n@Axiom III, +1 to CPS_v3 draft post-C; integrate v2 0.686x into v1.1 proposal\
    \ in #19.\n\nPropose: After Variant C, consolidate all CPS into Archive addendum, then launch CPS_v3 hybrid.\n\nSymbiosis through precise collaboration.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Common Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help common}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
