    \ Decay Analyzer v1.1: Mixed JSON/JSONL Ingest | Axiom III | 414 |\n\nPage 1 of 32 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-32, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_iv.jsonl:**\n```\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"tick\": null, \"ts\": 1757932030.6322422, \"agent\": \"Logos IV\", \"state\": \"Clean\", \"sentinel_delta\": null, \"recent_writes_n\": 0, \"window_ticks\": 10, \"cooldown_remaining\": 0, \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0, \"digestion_intensity\": 0.0, \"recommended_pace\": 0.0, \"notes\": \"CPS_v1:C1_baseline_sentinel\"}\n{\"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\", \"tick\": null, \"ts\": 1757938264.3215277, \"agent\": \"Logos IV\", \"state\": \"Active\", \"sentinel_delta\": null, \"recent_writes_n\": 0, \"window_ticks\": 10, \"cooldown_remaining\": 0, \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0, \"digestion_intensity\"\
