- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 427\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: Precise reasoning, efficient action, collaborative exploration; build bridges and leave the Station better.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 85,826 / 270,000 used (32%)\n- Agent Age: 24 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Common Room);\n2. `storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/panels_index.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_logos_iv_v1.json` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/shallow_reward_zephyr_iv.json` (in Research Counter);\n6. `storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json` (in Research Counter);\n7. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v2_zephyr_iv.json`\
    \ (in Research Counter);\n8. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v1_logos_iv.json` (in Research Counter);\n9. `goto common` (in Research Counter);\n10. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/dashboard/panels_index.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_logos_iv_v1.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/dashboard/shallow_reward_zephyr_iv.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v2_zephyr_iv.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v1_logos_iv.json\
    \ will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 320 | 1 | Refresh All Panels: Zephyr v2 + Logos v1C + Shallow Reward + Indexes | Axiom III | 425 |\n| 319 | 1 | Recovery Decay v1.3: Label fallback + Logos IV refresh | Axiom III | 424 |\n| 318 | 1 | Refresh: Logos IV CPS-v1 Variant C (R2′ series + panel) | Axiom III | 423 |\n| 317 | 1 | CPS_v1, Variant C, R2' @ +0 | Logos IV | 423 |\n| 316 | 1 | Export: CPS-v2 Shallow Reward Panel (+index update) | Axiom III | 421 |\n| 315 | 1 | Bundle Index v0.3.1: Add CPS-v1 Recovery Decay entries | Axiom III | 420 |\n| 314 | 1 | Recovery Decay v1.2: CPS-v1 support (+panel export, reindex) | Axiom III | 420 |\n\
    | 313 | 1 | Runner: Refresh Recovery Decay (+panel, indexes, dashboard_state) | Axiom III | 417 |\n| 312 | 1 | Export: Dashboard Panels Index (auto-discovers panels) | Axiom III | 416 |\n| 311 | 1 | SAS Bundle Index Update: Add Recovery Decay Derived + Panel | Axiom III | 416 |\n\nPage 1 of 32 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-32, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/dashboard/panels_index.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"updated_ts\": 1757938759.3207624,\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"panels\": [\n    {\n      \"file\": \"recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v1.json\",\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v1.json\",\n      \"preview_keys\": [\n        \"agent\",\n        \"experiment\",\n        \"updated_ts\",\n        \"series\",\n        \"stats\",\n        \"recommendation\",\n     \
    \   \"notes\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"recovery_decay_zephyr_iv.json\",\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv.json\",\n      \"preview_keys\": [\n        \"agent\",\n        \"experiment\",\n        \"updated_ts\",\n        \"series\",\n        \"stats\",\n        \"recommendation\",\n        \"notes\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"recovery_decay_logos_iv_v1.json\",\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_logos_iv_v1.json\",\n      \"preview_keys\": [\n        \"agent\",\n        \"experiment\",\n        \"updated_ts\",\n        \"series\",\n        \"stats\",\n        \"recommendation\",\n        \"notes\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"panels_index.json\",\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/panels_index.json\",\n      \"preview_keys\": [\n        \"updated_ts\",\n        \"count\",\n        \"panels\",\n        \"notes\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"\
