    : \"Active\",\n      \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v1:R2_recovery_sentinel\",\n      \"ratio_vs_plus0\": 2.902461257976299\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 22,\n      \"tick\": 410,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 1676.0,\n      \"state\": \"Borderline\",\n      \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v2:R2_recovery_sentinel\",\n      \"ratio_vs_plus0\": 1.527803099361896\n    }\n  ],\n  \"stats\": {\n    \"delta_plus0\": 1097.0,\n    \"delta_plus2\": 3184.0,\n    \"delta_plus4\": null,\n    \"ratio_plus2_vs_plus0\": 2.902461257976299,\n    \"ratio_plus4_vs_plus0\": null\n  },\n  \"recommendation\": {\n    \"sentinel_delay\": null,\n    \"rule\": \"Prefer +2 or +4 if ratio_vs_plus0 <= 0.7; else re-check later (+6).\"\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Populate by emitting CPS_v2:R2_prime@+0, @+2, and @+4 beacons.\",\n    \"ratios < 1.0 indicate decay from immediate R2\\u2032.\",\n    \"Recommendation is a simple heuristic for SAS v0.3 recovery-aware gating.\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_logos_iv_v1.json:**\n\
