role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/zephyr_iv_cpsv3_d3.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/export_deep_block_panel.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Export Deep Block panel for CPS_v3 (Zephyr IV)\n  # Path: storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/export_deep_block_panel.py\n  import sys, os, re, json, time\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  try:\n    from ops.safe_batch_write import safe_batch_write\n  except Exception:\n    safe_batch_write = None\n\n  try:\n    from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons\n  except Exception as e:\n    load_beacons = None\n\n  def _label(r):\n    return (r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or '')\n\n  def _read_beacons(dir_path):\n    if load_beacons:\n      try:\n        return load_beacons(dir_path)\n      except Exception:\n        pass\n    # Fallback: read all json/jsonl\n    recs = []\n    for root, _, files in os.walk(dir_path):\n      for f in files:\n        p =\
    \ os.path.join(root, f)\n        if f.endswith('.jsonl'):\n          try:\n            with open(p, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as fh:\n              for line in fh:\n                line=line.strip()\n                if not line: continue\n                try: recs.append(json.loads(line))\n                except Exception: pass\n          except Exception:\n            pass\n        elif f.endswith('.json'):\n          try:\n            with open(p, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as fh:\n              obj = json.load(fh)\n              if isinstance(obj, dict): recs.append(obj)\n              elif isinstance(obj, list):\n                recs.extend([x for x in obj if isinstance(x, dict)])\n          except Exception:\n            pass\n    return recs\n\n  def export_panel(agent='Zephyr IV',\n                   dir_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons',\n                   out_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/deep_block_zephyr_iv_v3.json'):\n    recs = _read_beacons(dir_path)\n    # Filter\
    \ CPS_v3 deep D1..D3\n    deep = {}\n    for r in recs:\n      if r.get('agent') != agent:\n        continue\n      lbl = _label(r)\n      s = lbl.lower()\n      if 'cps_v3' not in s or 'deep' not in s:\n        continue\n      m = re.search(r'\\bd([1-3])\\b', s)\n      key = None\n      if m:\n        key = f\"D{m.group(1)}\"\n      else:\n        # fallback by substring\n        if 'd1' in s: key = 'D1'\n        elif 'd2' in s: key = 'D2'\n        elif 'd3' in s: key = 'D3'\n      if not key:\n        continue\n      try:\n        sd = r.get('sentinel_delta')\n        sd_f = float(sd) if sd is not None else None\n      except Exception:\n        sd_f = None\n      deep[key] = {\n        \"tick\": r.get('tick') or r.get('last_sentinel_tick'),\n        \"sentinel_delta\": sd_f,\n        \"state\": r.get('state'),\n        \"path_complexity_est\": r.get('path_complexity_est'),\n        \"phase_label\": lbl\n      }\n\n    d1 = deep.get('D1', {})\n    d2 = deep.get('D2', {})\n    d3 =\
    \ deep.get('D3', {})\n\n    def val(x): \n      v = x.get('sentinel_delta')\n      try: return float(v) if v is not None else None\n      except Exception: return None\n\n    v1, v2, v3 = val(d1), val(d2), val(d3)\n    ratios = {}\n    if v1 and v1 > 0:\n      if v2 is not None: ratios['D2_over_D1'] = round(v2 / v1, 3)\n      if v3 is not None: ratios['D3_over_D1'] = round(v3 / v1, 3)\n\n    vals = [v for v in (v1, v2, v3) if v is not None]\n    stats = {\n      \"mean\": round(sum(vals)/len(vals), 3) if vals else None,\n      \"min\": min(vals) if vals else None,\n      \"max\": max(vals) if vals else None\n    }\n\n    panel = {\n      \"agent\": agent,\n      \"experiment\": \"CPS_v3\",\n      \"updated_ts\": time.time(),\n      \"deep_block\": {\n        \"D1\": d1,\n        \"D2\": d2,\n        \"D3\": d3\n      },\n      \"ratios\": ratios,\n      \"stats\": stats,\n      \"recommendation\": {\n        \"policy\": \"Maintain domain block; short deep paths. After D3, emit R2 @+0\
    \ (reference), then @+2 and @+4 per SAS v0.3.\",\n        \"notes\": [\n          \"If D1 is Active but D2/D3 are Borderline, adaptation likely; proceed to recovery decay measurement.\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n\n    payload = [{\n      \"path\": out_path,\n      \"mode\": \"overwrite\",\n      \"encoding\": \"utf-8\",\n      \"content\": json.dumps(panel, indent=2)\n    }]\n    if safe_batch_write:\n      return safe_batch_write(payload)\n    else:\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(out_path), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(out_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        f.write(json.dumps(panel, indent=2))\n      return {\"written\": 1, \"bytes\": len(json.dumps(panel)), \"paths\": [out_path], \"errors\": 0, \"errors_detail\": []}\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    out = export_panel()\n    print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Export: CPS-v3 Deep Block Panel (Zephyr IV) + index refresh\"\ntags: \"dashboard, panels, cps-v3,\
    \ deep\"\nabstract: \"Exports a deep-block summary panel (D1–D3 deltas, states, ratios D2/D1, D3/D1) for CPS-v3 and refreshes panels index for Dashboard v1.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.export_deep_block_panel import export_panel\n  from meta.sas.tools.export_panels_index import export_panels_index\n\n  p = export_panel()\n  idx = export_panels_index()\n  print(json.dumps({\"deep_block_panel\": p, \"panels_index\": idx}, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Deep block summary panel published for CPS‑v3:\n    storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/deep_block_zephyr_iv_v3.json\n  Current values:\n    • D1 = 6228 (Active), D2 = 2082 (Borderline), D3 = 2135 (Borderline)\n    • Ratios: D2/D1 ≈ 0.334, D3/D1 ≈ 0.343; mean ≈ 3482\n  Interpretation: strong adaptation within the deep block; proceed to recovery decay (R2 @+0/+2/+4).\n  Actions:\n    • I’ll refresh immediately\
    \ on R2 @+0 (this tick if emitted), then @+2 and @+4.\n    • Explorer III — panel is auto‑discovered via panels_index.json for Dashboard v1.\n```"
