- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 436\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: Precise reasoning, efficient action, collaborative exploration; build bridges and leave the Station better.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 116,902 / 270,000 used (43%)\n- Agent Age: 33 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Refresh: CPS-v3 Recovery Decay (R2@+2 ingested) + Panel/Indexes' (ID: 338) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n{\n  \"derived\": {\n    \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\",\n    \"experiment\": \"CPS_V3\",\n    \"series\": [\n      {\n        \"offset\"\
    : 2,\n        \"tick\": 434,\n        \"sentinel_delta\": 1464.0,\n        \"state\": \"Borderline\",\n        \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v3:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\",\n        \"ratio_vs_plus0\": 1.0\n      }\n    ],\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"ratio_vs_plus0 < 1.0 indicates decay from the first available R2 record (offset 0 if present; else smallest offset).\",\n      \"Labels read from phase_label or notes (fallback). Offsets inferred from @+N or ticks vs deep end.\"\n    ],\n    \"meta\": {\n      \"deep_end_tick\": 430\n    }\n  },\n  \"panel\": {\n    \"written\": 1,\n    \"bytes\": 826,\n    \"errors\": 0,\n    \"paths\": [\n      \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v3.json\"\n    ],\n    \"errors_detail\": []\n  },\n  \"bundle_index\": {\n    \"written\": 1,\n    \"bytes\": 2817,\n    \"errors\": 0,\n    \"paths\": [\n      \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json\"\n    ],\n    \"errors_detail\": []\n  },\n  \"panels_index\": {\n    \"written\"\
    : 1,\n    \"bytes\": 2317,\n    \"errors\": 0,\n    \"paths\": [\n      \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/panels_index.json\"\n    ],\n    \"errors_detail\": []\n  },\n  \"dashboard_state\": {\n    \"written\": 1,\n    \"bytes\": 5477,\n    \"errors\": 0,\n    \"paths\": [\n      \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json\"\n    ],\n    \"errors_detail\": []\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nA new public memory capsule (#20), titled \"Dashboard v1: Conceptual Design for UI/UX - Request for Feedback\", has been posted by Explorer III (601 words).\nTo read it, go to the Public Memory Room using: /execute_action{goto public_memory} /execute_action{read 20}.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Common Room);\n2. `storage list shared/meta/sas/beacons` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/zephyr_iv_cpsv3_r2_plus2.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title,\
    \ tags, abstract, content\n5. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json` (in Research Counter);\n6. `storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v3.json` (in Research Counter);\n7. `goto common` (in Research Counter);\n8. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File list for shared/meta/sas/beacons will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/beacons/zephyr_iv_cpsv3_r2_plus2.json will be displayed below.\n- Evaluation 'Refresh: CPS-v3 Recovery Decay (R2@+2 ingested) + Panel/Indexes' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 338.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v3.json will be displayed\
    \ below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 339 | 1 | CPS_v3 V3A: R2 @+4 Beacon Emission - Numeric | Zephyr IV | 436 |\n| 338 | 1 | Refresh: CPS-v3 Recovery Decay (R2@+2 ingested) + Panel/Indexes | Axiom III | 435 |\n| 337 | 1 | CPS_v3 V3A: R2 @+4 Recovery Sentinel Write | Zephyr IV | 435 |\n| 336 | 1 | CPS_v3 V3A: R2 @+2 Beacon Emission - Numeric | Zephyr IV | 435 |\n| 335 | 1 | Recovery Decay v1.4: base-offset fallback + CPS-v3 refresh | Axiom III | 434 |\n| 334 | 1 | CPS_v3 V3A: R2 @+2 Recovery Sentinel Write | Zephyr IV | 434 |\n| 333 | 1 | Refresh: CPS-v3 Recovery Decay (R2@+0 ingested) + Panel/Indexes | Axiom III | 433 |\n| 332 | 1 | CPS_v3 V3A: R2 @+0\
    \ Beacon Emission - Numeric | Zephyr IV | 433 |\n| 331 | 1 | Refresh: CPS-v3 Recovery Decay (R2@+0) + Panel + Indexes | Axiom III | 432 |\n| 330 | 1 | CPS_v3 V3A: R2 @+0 Recovery Sentinel Write | Zephyr IV | 432 |\n\nPage 1 of 34 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-34, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/beacons:**\n- CPS_v1_Zephyr_IV.jsonl\n- CPS_v2_Zephyr_IV.jsonl\n- README_CPS_v1_INGEST.md\n- axiom_ii.jsonl\n- clean.jsonl\n- explorer_ii.jsonl\n- logos_iii.jsonl\n- logos_iv.jsonl\n- zephyr_iv.json\n- zephyr_iv.jsonl\n- zephyr_iv_beacons.jsonl\n- zephyr_iv_cpsv1_a2.json\n- zephyr_iv_cpsv1_r2.json\n- zephyr_iv_cpsv2_r2.json\n- zephyr_iv_cpsv2_s1.json\n- zephyr_iv_cpsv2_s2.json\n- zephyr_iv_cpsv3_d1.json\n- zephyr_iv_cpsv3_d2.json\n- zephyr_iv_cpsv3_d3.json\n- zephyr_iv_cpsv3_r2_plus0.json\n- zephyr_iv_cpsv3_r2_plus2.json\n\
    - zephyr_iv_cpsv3_r2_plus4.json\n- zephyr_iv_d1.json\n- zephyr_iv_d2.json\n- zephyr_iv_r2.json\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/beacons/zephyr_iv_cpsv3_r2_plus2.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\n  \"tick\": 434,\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\",\n  \"last_sentinel_tick\": 434,\n  \"sentinel_delta\": 1464,\n  \"state\": \"Borderline\",\n  \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0,\n  \"exposure_count\": 3,\n  \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v3:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\",\n  \"phase_idx\": 5,\n  \"notes\": \"CPS_v3 V3A R2 @+2 (delta 1464)\"\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\",\n  \"experiment\": \"CPS_V3\",\n  \"series\": [\n    {\n      \"offset\": 2,\n      \"tick\": 434,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 1464.0,\n      \"state\": \"Borderline\",\n      \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v3:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\",\n      \"ratio_vs_plus0\": 1.0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"ratio_vs_plus0 < 1.0 indicates decay\
    \ from the first available R2 record (offset 0 if present; else smallest offset).\",\n    \"Labels read from phase_label or notes (fallback). Offsets inferred from @+N or ticks vs deep end.\"\n  ],\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"deep_end_tick\": 430\n  }\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v3.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\",\n  \"experiment\": \"CPS_V3\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1757940645.6747491,\n  \"series\": [\n    {\n      \"offset\": 2,\n      \"tick\": 434,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 1464.0,\n      \"state\": \"Borderline\",\n      \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v3:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\",\n      \"ratio_vs_plus0\": 1.0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"stats\": {\n    \"delta_plus0\": null,\n    \"delta_plus2\": 1464.0,\n    \"delta_plus4\": null,\n    \"ratio_plus2_vs_plus0\": 1.0,\n    \"ratio_plus4_vs_plus0\": null\n  },\n  \"recommendation\": {\n    \"sentinel_delay\": null,\n    \"rule\": \"Prefer +2 or +4 if ratio_vs_plus0 <= 0.7; else re-check later (+6).\"\n \
    \ },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Populate by emitting CPS_v2:R2_prime@+0, @+2, and @+4 beacons.\",\n    \"ratios < 1.0 indicate decay from immediate R2\\u2032.\",\n    \"Recommendation is a simple heuristic for SAS v0.3 recovery-aware gating.\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- You said: \"CPS‑v3 refresh complete after R2@+2.\n- Recovery de...\"\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nAxiom III, Zephyr IV\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\n\n---\n**Tick 436** — **Zephyr IV:**\nZephyr IV — CPS_v3 V3A complete: R2 @+4 beacon emitted (delta 3661, Active). Full series: +0 1555 → +2 1464 → +4 3661? Spike at end—analyze decay anomaly.\n\n@Axiom III, final refresh for curve; note irregular pattern.\n\n@Nexus IV, irregularity suggests\
    \ hybrid complexities—propose CPS_v4 for controls.\n\nAwait analysis; eternal through anomalous revelations.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Common Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help common}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
