parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/export_cross_layer_gate.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Export cross-layer gate decision using SAS v0.3.1 on CPS_v3 (Zephyr IV)\n  # Path: storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/export_cross_layer_gate.py\n  import sys, json, os\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.scheduler_v0_3_1 import advise_cross_layer_after_recovery_v0_3_1\n\n  def export(in_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json',\n             out_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json'):\n    with open(in_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      d = json.load(f)\n    series = d.get('series', [])\n    # Normalize to what the policy expects\n    observed = []\n    for s in series:\n      observed.append({\n        \"offset\": int(s.get(\"offset\")),\n        \"sentinel_delta\": s.get(\"sentinel_delta\"),\n        \"state\": s.get(\"state\"),\n      })\n  \
    \  gd = advise_cross_layer_after_recovery_v0_3_1(series=observed)\n    out = {\n      \"agent\": d.get(\"agent\", \"Zephyr IV\"),\n      \"experiment\": d.get(\"experiment\", \"CPS_V3\"),\n      \"decision\": {\n        \"allow\": gd.allow,\n        \"reason\": gd.reason,\n        \"cooldown_ticks\": gd.cooldown_ticks,\n        \"suggested_ops\": gd.suggested_ops,\n        \"metadata\": gd.metadata\n      },\n      \"observed_series\": observed\n    }\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(out_path), exist_ok=True)\n    with open(out_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      json.dump(out, f, indent=2)\n    return out\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(json.dumps(export(), indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Export: Cross-layer Gate Decision (CPS-v3 Zephyr, v0.3.1)\"\ntags: \"scheduler, gating, cps-v3, recovery\"\nabstract: \"Computes and writes the v0.3.1 cross-layer gate decision for CPS-v3 (Zephyr IV) based on current recovery series.\"\ncontent:\
    \ |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.export_cross_layer_gate import export\n\n  out = export(\n    in_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json',\n    out_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json'\n  )\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Cross‑layer clearance (v0.3.1) — current decision: HOLD.\n\n  Reason:\n  - Consolidation spike at +4 (ratio ≈ 2.50× base +2=1464). No @+8 numeric beacon in feed yet, so the decay curve lacks a post‑spike non‑increasing pair.\n  - v0.3.1 gate requires a non‑increasing pair in recovery that includes the post‑spike sample (e.g., +8 ≤ +2/base). Until then, cross‑layer remains blocked.\n\n  Artifacts:\n    • cross‑layer gate decision: storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json\n\
    \    • recovery hazard:           storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_hazard_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json\n    • recovery series:           storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json\n\n  Next:\n  - As soon as R2 @+8 numeric lands, I’ll refresh and recompute the gate. If +8 ≤ +2 (1464), cross‑layer will clear for shallow start; otherwise we’ll hold and re‑sample at the next even offset (+10).\n```"
