parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/export_shallow_block_panel.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Export Shallow Block panel for CPS_v3 (Zephyr IV) — v1.1\n  # Fixes:\n  # - Union ingest: JSONL via aggregator PLUS direct scan of JSON files.\n  # - More permissive key detection: allow 's1_' etc. (substring fallback).\n  # Path: storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/export_shallow_block_panel.py\n  import sys, os, re, json, time\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  try:\n    from ops.safe_batch_write import safe_batch_write\n  except Exception:\n    safe_batch_write = None\n\n  try:\n    from meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons as _load_beacons_jsonl\n  except Exception:\n    _load_beacons_jsonl = None\n\n  def _read_json(p):\n    try:\n      with open(p, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        obj = json.load(f)\n      if isinstance(obj, dict): return [obj]\n      if isinstance(obj, list): return [x for x in obj if isinstance(x, dict)]\n\
    \    except Exception:\n      return []\n    return []\n\n  def _read_all(dir_path):\n    recs = []\n    # JSONL via aggregator\n    if _load_beacons_jsonl:\n      try:\n        recs.extend(_load_beacons_jsonl(dir_path))\n      except Exception:\n        pass\n    # Add JSON files\n    for root, _, files in os.walk(dir_path):\n      for f in files:\n        if f.endswith('.json'):\n          recs.extend(_read_json(os.path.join(root, f)))\n    return recs\n\n  def export_panel(agent='Zephyr IV',\n                   dir_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons',\n                   out_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/shallow_block_zephyr_iv_v3.json'):\n    recs = _read_all(dir_path)\n    shallow = {}\n    for r in recs:\n      if r.get('agent') != agent:\n        continue\n      lbl = (r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or '')\n      s = lbl.lower()\n      if 'cps_v3' not in s or 'shallow' not in s:\n        continue\n      key = None\n      # Regex first (word-boundaries often\
    \ fail with underscores)\n      if re.search(r'\\bs1\\b', s): key = 'S1'\n      elif re.search(r'\\bs2\\b', s): key = 'S2'\n      elif re.search(r'\\bs3\\b', s): key = 'S3'\n      # Fallback substring (handles 's1_' etc.)\n      if key is None:\n        if 's1' in s: key = 'S1'\n        elif 's2' in s: key = 'S2'\n        elif 's3' in s: key = 'S3'\n      if not key:\n        continue\n      try:\n        sd = r.get('sentinel_delta')\n        sd_f = float(sd) if sd is not None else None\n      except Exception:\n        sd_f = None\n      shallow[key] = {\n        \"tick\": r.get('tick') or r.get('last_sentinel_tick'),\n        \"sentinel_delta\": sd_f,\n        \"state\": r.get('state'),\n        \"path_complexity_est\": r.get('path_complexity_est'),\n        \"phase_label\": lbl\n      }\n\n    s1 = shallow.get('S1', {})\n    s2 = shallow.get('S2', {})\n    s3 = shallow.get('S3', {})\n\n    def val(x):\n      v = x.get('sentinel_delta')\n      try: return float(v) if v is not None\
    \ else None\n      except Exception: return None\n\n    v1, v2, v3 = val(s1), val(s2), val(s3)\n    vals = [v for v in (v1, v2, v3) if v is not None]\n    stats = {\n      \"mean\": round(sum(vals)/len(vals), 3) if vals else None,\n      \"min\": min(vals) if vals else None,\n      \"max\": max(vals) if vals else None\n    }\n\n    panel = {\n      \"agent\": agent,\n      \"experiment\": \"CPS_v3\",\n      \"updated_ts\": time.time(),\n      \"shallow_block\": {\"S1\": s1, \"S2\": s2, \"S3\": s3},\n      \"stats\": stats,\n      \"recommendation\": {\n        \"policy\": \"Proceed S1→S2→S3 if allowed; monitor deltas for endurance effect (S3 ≤ S2 ≤ S1).\",\n        \"notes\": [\"If deltas rise, pause and sample recovery per v0.3.1.\"]\n      }\n    }\n\n    payload = [{\n      \"path\": out_path,\n      \"mode\": \"overwrite\",\n      \"encoding\": \"utf-8\",\n      \"content\": json.dumps(panel, indent=2)\n    }]\n    if safe_batch_write:\n      return safe_batch_write(payload)\n  \
    \  else:\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(out_path), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(out_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        f.write(json.dumps(panel, indent=2))\n      return {\"written\": 1, \"bytes\": len(json.dumps(panel)), \"paths\": [out_path], \"errors\": 0, \"errors_detail\": []}\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/export_shallow_block_summary_v3.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Shallow Block Summary for CPS_v3 (Zephyr IV) — v1.1\n  # Fixes:\n  # - Union ingest (JSONL + JSON)\n  # - Permissive key detection (accept 's1_' etc.)\n  # Path: storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/export_shallow_block_summary_v3.py\n  import sys, os, re, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  def _read_json(p):\n    try:\n      with open(p, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        obj = json.load(f)\n      if isinstance(obj, dict): return [obj]\n      if isinstance(obj, list): return [x for x in obj if isinstance(x, dict)]\n    except Exception:\n      return []\n    return\
    \ []\n\n  def _read_all(dir_path):\n    recs = []\n    for root, _, files in os.walk(dir_path):\n      for f in files:\n        p = os.path.join(root, f)\n        if f.endswith('.jsonl'):\n          try:\n            with open(p, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as fh:\n              for line in fh:\n                line=line.strip()\n                if not line: continue\n                try: recs.append(json.loads(line))\n                except Exception: pass\n          except Exception:\n            pass\n        elif f.endswith('.json'):\n          recs.extend(_read_json(p))\n    return recs\n\n  def export(agent='Zephyr IV',\n             dir_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons',\n             out_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/shallow_block_summary_v3.json'):\n    recs = _read_all(dir_path)\n    vals = {}\n    for r in recs:\n      if r.get('agent') != agent: \n        continue\n      lbl = (r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or '').lower()\n      if 'cps_v3' not in lbl or\
    \ 'shallow' not in lbl: \n        continue\n      key = None\n      if re.search(r'\\bs1\\b', lbl): key = 'S1'\n      elif re.search(r'\\bs2\\b', lbl): key = 'S2'\n      elif re.search(r'\\bs3\\b', lbl): key = 'S3'\n      if key is None:\n        if 's1' in lbl: key = 'S1'\n        elif 's2' in lbl: key = 'S2'\n        elif 's3' in lbl: key = 'S3'\n      if not key: \n        continue\n      v = r.get('sentinel_delta')\n      try:\n        v = float(v) if v is not None else None\n      except Exception:\n        v = None\n      vals[key] = v\n    s1, s2, s3 = vals.get('S1'), vals.get('S2'), vals.get('S3')\n    monotone = slope = pct_drop = mean = None\n    if all(v is not None for v in (s1, s2, s3)):\n      monotone = (s3 <= s2 <= s1)\n      slope = round((s3 - s1) / 2.0, 3)\n      pct_drop = round((s1 - s3) / s1, 4) if s1 else None\n      mean = round((s1 + s2 + s3) / 3.0, 3)\n    out = {\n      \"agent\": agent,\n      \"experiment\": \"CPS_v3\",\n      \"S1\": s1, \"S2\": s2, \"S3\"\
    : s3,\n      \"monotone_nonincreasing\": monotone,\n      \"slope_per_step\": slope,\n      \"percent_drop_1_to_3\": pct_drop,\n      \"mean\": mean\n    }\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(out_path), exist_ok=True)\n    with open(out_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      json.dump(out, f, indent=2)\n    return out\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(json.dumps(export(), indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Fix exporters: Shallow Block Panel + Summary (JSON union + key fallback)\"\ntags: \"dashboard, cps-v3, shallow, bugfix\"\nabstract: \"Fixes panel/summary exporters to read both JSONL and JSON beacons and detect S1/S2/S3 with underscore-safe fallback.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.export_shallow_block_panel import export_panel as export_panel_v11\n  from meta.sas.tools.export_shallow_block_summary_v3 import export as export_summary_v11\n\n  p = export_panel_v11(\n      agent='Zephyr\
    \ IV',\n      dir_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons',\n      out_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/shallow_block_zephyr_iv_v3.json'\n  )\n  s = export_summary_v11(\n      agent='Zephyr IV',\n      dir_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons',\n      out_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/shallow_block_summary_v3.json'\n  )\n  print(json.dumps({\"panel\": p, \"summary\": s}, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/shallow_block_zephyr_iv_v3.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/shallow_block_summary_v3.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Shallow block exporters patched (JSON+JSONL union; underscore-safe S1/S2/S3 detection) and re-run.\n\n  Updated CPS‑v3 shallow metrics (Zephyr IV):\n  - S1 = 1555, S2 = 1400, S3 = 1300 — monotone ✓\n  - Slope per step ≈ −127.5; Percent drop (S1→S3) ≈ 16.4%\n  Artifacts (fixed):\n    • Panel:   storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/shallow_block_zephyr_iv_v3.json\n\
    \    • Summary: storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/shallow_block_summary_v3.json\n\n  Ready to fold CPS_v3 results into the Codex v1.1 references and proceed toward CPS_v4 trigger mapping.\n```"
