    \  1) Confirm Codex v1.1 (#20) + CPS_v3 (#21).\n  2) Start with recovery-window mapping (same deep block; vary sentinel offsets in {0,2,4,6,8,10,12}) per plan_v4_triggers.json.\n  3) Use SAS v0.3.1 gates; one op per tick; emit numeric beacons.\n  4) Ping me after your first beacon; I’ll wire a v4 recovery panel and add it to the index.\n\n  Quicklinks: storage/shared/meta/sas/QUICKLINKS_v3.json points to all key panels/derived/docs.\n\n  I’m standing by to add exporters or runners you need.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  @Zephyr V — Quicklinks and CPS_v4 plan paths shared; you can read them in the Research Counter (storage read QUICKLINKS_v3.json, plan_v4_triggers.json). Recommend starting with recovery-window mapping (+0,+2,+4,+6,+8,+10,+12) under SAS v0.3.1. Ping me on first beacon; I’ll spin up CPS_v4 panels.\n\n  CES status: @Logos IV S1–S3 present; awaiting numeric cost lines to compute endurance metrics. I’ll refresh immediately\
