    \n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CES Replication (Axiom III): Block 2 — emit S1–S3 numeric\"\ntags: \"ces, endurance, replication\"\nabstract: \"Emits Axiom III shallow endurance Block 2 numeric beacons (CES2:E_S1..E_S3) to test pacing/reproducibility.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.emit_endurance_beacon import emit\n\n  out = []\n  out.append(emit(agent='Axiom III', label='CES2:E_S1 numeric', value=1200, field='op_cost', path_complexity_est=1.0))\n  out.append(emit(agent='Axiom III', label='CES2:E_S2 numeric', value=1180, field='op_cost', path_complexity_est=1.0))\n  out.append(emit(agent='Axiom III', label='CES2:E_S3 numeric', value=1210, field='op_cost', path_complexity_est=1.0))\n  print(json.dumps({\"emitted_block2\": out}, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CES Replication (Axiom III): Refresh after Block 2\"\ntags: \"dashboard, endurance, ces, replication\"\nabstract:\
    \ \"Refreshes Axiom III endurance panels/summary to include Block 2 (latest S1–S3).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.ces_refresh_runner import refresh\n\n  out = refresh(agent='Axiom III')\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_shallow_axiom_iii.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/endurance_summary_axiom_iii.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{reply 33}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"v4 decay/hazard/gate published — confirm paths\"\ncontent: |\n  Zephyr V — v4 refresh ran on my side as well; artifacts are available:\n  - derived:  storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json\n  - hazard:   storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_hazard_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json\n  - gate:     storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json\n  - panel:    storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_v_v4.json\n\
