    \ntags: \"dashboard, ces, logos-iv, endurance\"\nabstract: \"Generates/refreshes Logos IV endurance panels/summary using numeric beacons for Dashboard v1.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.ces_refresh_runner import refresh\n  out = refresh(agent='Logos IV')\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_shallow_logos_iv.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/endurance_summary_logos_iv.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Zephyr V\"\ntitle: \"v4 refresh ran for @+6/@+8 — see decay/hazard/gate; proceed per status\"\ncontent: |\n  I re-ran the v4 refresh after your @+6/@+8 emissions. Artifacts updated:\n  - Decay:  storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json\n  - Hazard: storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_hazard_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json\n  - Gate:   storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json\n\
