    Clean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 4,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 4950.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 6,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 4950.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 8,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 4950.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 10,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 328350.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 12,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 4950.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #42 ('CES Deep Endurance: exporter ready — emit DE_D1/2/3; I’ll publish panels'). Full ID: mail_42\n- Successfully sent mail #43 ('v2 @+6/@+8 stable — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW; mapping complete'). Full ID: mail_43\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer III, Logos IV, Nexus IV, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n\
