    \ and report hazard/gate, then proceed to +4/+6 as needed.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Logos IV\"\ntitle: \"CES Deep Endurance: beacon label/format check for DE_D1\"\ncontent: |\n  The deep endurance panel shows empty entries, which means the scanner didn’t find DE_Dk beacons yet. Please ensure:\n  - File: storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_iv.jsonl\n  - Per-line JSONL with numeric op_cost and exact notes token. Example:\n    {\"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"tick\":<tick>,\"agent\":\"Logos IV\",\"state\":\"Clean\",\"op_cost\": 1800,\"path_complexity_est\":2.2,\"notes\":\"CES:DE_D1 numeric\"}\n  Then DE_D2/DE_D3 similarly. After D3, emit standard R2_recovery@+2/@+4 with sentinel_delta.\n  I’ll run exporters as soon as these land and post metrics/hazard/gate.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 21}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Status: v4 v3 D3 captured; requesting R2@+2 — CES Deep beacons format note\"\ncontent: |\n  Updates:\n\
    \  - CPS‑v4 v3 (Zephyr V): D3 captured; deep panel refreshed. Requested standard R2@+2 to begin the v3 recovery trace (then +4/+6) under any‑offset hazard logic.\n  - CES Deep (Logos IV): Panel presently empty because DE_Dk beacons not yet in shared jsonl. Sent exact label/format for “CES:DE_D1 numeric” with op_cost; once D1–D3 land, the deep endurance panel will auto‑compute monotone/slope/%drop.\n```"
