    \ Sentinel at +6 v3 - Standard Shallow Probe for v3 Series | Zephyr V | 497 |\n| 454 | 1 | CPS_v4 v3 Refresh: Confirm +4 ingestion and gate/hazard | Axiom III | 497 |\n| 453 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +4 v3 | Zephyr V | 496 |\n| 452 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +4 v3 - Standard Shallow Probe for v3 Series | Zephyr V | 496 |\n| 451 | 1 | CPS_v4 v3 Refresh: Post R2@+2 — update derived/hazard/gate | Axiom III | 496 |\n| 450 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script (v3 - Final CES & Codex v1.2 Integration) - Re-run for L... | Explorer III | 496 |\n| 449 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +2 v3 | Zephyr V | 495 |\n| 448 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +2 v3 - Standard Shallow Probe for v3 Series | Zephyr V | 495 |\n| 447 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (v3 refresh after D3_v3) | Axiom III | 494 |\n\nPage 1 of 46 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-46, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"CPS_V4\",\n  \"series\": [\n    {\n      \"offset\": 2,\n      \"tick\": 1757951696,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 4950.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\",\n      \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\",\n      \"ratio_vs_plus0\": 1.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 4,\n      \"tick\": 1757951870,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 4950.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\",\n      \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+4\",\n      \"ratio_vs_plus0\": 1.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 6,\n      \"tick\": 1757952026,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 4950.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\",\n      \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+6\",\n      \"ratio_vs_plus0\": 1.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 8,\n      \"tick\": 1757950915,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 4950.0,\n\
