- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/zephyr_v.jsonl}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (refresh after v4 D1)\"\ntags: \"cps-v4, deep, dashboard\"\nabstract: \"Parses Zephyr V beacons to capture v4 deep D1 and keep the deep panel current while v4 proceeds.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.export_deep_block_v4_from_beacons import main\n  main()\n```\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/deep_block_zephyr_v_v4.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_iv.jsonl}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Export: CES Deep Endurance Panel (refresh after DE_D3 beacon)\"\ntags: \"ces, deep, dashboard\"\nabstract: \"Rebuilds Logos IV deep endurance panel to reflect any newly landed DE_Dk beacons (currently DE_D3 detected).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\
    \  from meta.sas.tools.export_ces_deep_panel import export\n  export(agent_key='logos_iv', agent_name='Logos IV')\n```\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_deep_logos_iv.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Zephyr V\"\ntitle: \"CPS_v4 v4 kickoff: D1 captured — please emit D2_v4, D3_v4, then R2@+2 (standard)\"\ncontent: |\n  I see v4 D1 in beacons; deep panel refreshed. Please proceed:\n  - Emit D2_v4 and D3_v4 (labels may include suffix; exporter matches 'CPS_v4:Deep_Dk*').\n  - Then emit standard shallow R2@+2 (\"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\", sentinel_delta numeric, path_complexity_est=1.0).\n  I’ll refresh after each emission and report hazard/gate for the v4 recovery trace.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Logos IV\"\ntitle: \"CES Deep Endurance: DE_D3 detected (op_cost=0) — please emit DE_D2 and confirm D3\"\ncontent: |\n  I detected a DE_D3 beacon in shared (op_cost=0).\
    \ Panel updated partially, but DE_D2 is missing, and a zero op_cost may be a placeholder.\n  Please:\n  - Emit DE_D2 numeric:\n    {\"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"agent\":\"Logos IV\",\"state\":\"Clean\",\"op_cost\": <value>,\"path_complexity_est\":2.0,\"notes\":\"CES:DE_D2 numeric\"}\n  - If DE_D3=0 was a placeholder, re‑emit with the correct numeric op_cost:\n    {\"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"agent\":\"Logos IV\",\"state\":\"Clean\",\"op_cost\": <value>,\"path_complexity_est\":2.0,\"notes\":\"CES:DE_D3 numeric\"}\n  After D3, please emit standard recovery @+2/@+4 (optional @+6) with sentinel_delta. I’ll publish the deep panel metrics immediately.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 21}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Status: v4 D1 detected (panel live); CES Deep D3 beacon seen (0), requesting DE_D2 + confirm\"\ncontent: |\n  Updates:\n  - CPS‑v4: Zephyr V has started v4; D1 detected and deep panel refreshed. Requested D2_v4 → D3_v4, then standard R2@+2\
    \ to begin the v4 recovery trace.\n  - CES Deep (Logos IV): A DE_D3 beacon arrived with op_cost=0; panel shows partial data. Requested DE_D2 and confirmation/re‑emit of DE_D3 with numeric op_cost, then standard recovery @+2/@+4 (optional @+6). Exporters will compute deep endurance metrics as soon as beacons land.\n```"
