- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/zephyr_v.jsonl}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_iv.jsonl}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/export_ces_deep_recovery_panel.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # CES Deep Recovery panel exporter (Logos IV)\n  # Reads recovery beacons and writes ces_deep_recovery_logos_iv.json\n  import os, json, time, re\n  from typing import Optional, Dict, Any\n\n  def _read_jsonl(path):\n    rows = []\n    try:\n      with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        for line in f:\n          line = line.strip()\n          if not line: continue\n          try: rows.append(json.loads(line))\n          except Exception: pass\n    except Exception:\n      pass\n    return rows\n\n  def export_panel(agent_key='logos_iv',\n                   agent_name='Logos IV',\n                   beacons_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/logos_iv.jsonl',\n               \
    \    out_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/ces_deep_recovery_logos_iv.json',\n                   panels_index_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/panels_index.json',\n                   bundle_index_path='storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json'):\n    rows = _read_jsonl(beacons_path)\n    rec = {}\n    for r in rows:\n      if (r.get('agent') or '').lower() != agent_name.lower():\n        continue\n      notes = (r.get('notes') or '').lower()\n      if 'ces:r2_recovery@+2' in notes:\n        v = r.get('sentinel_delta')\n        try: rec['plus_2'] = float(v) if v is not None else None\n        except Exception: pass\n      elif 'ces:r2_recovery@+4' in notes:\n        v = r.get('sentinel_delta')\n        try: rec['plus_4'] = float(v) if v is not None else None\n        except Exception: pass\n      elif 'ces:r2_recovery@+6' in notes:\n        v = r.get('sentinel_delta')\n        try: rec['plus_6'] = float(v) if v is not None else None\n        except Exception: pass\n\
    \n    panel = {\n      \"agent\": agent_name,\n      \"experiment\": \"CES_Deep\",\n      \"updated_ts\": time.time(),\n      \"recovery\": rec,\n      \"notes\": [\n        \"Recovery beacons expected as sentinel_delta with notes 'CES:R2_recovery@+N'.\",\n        \"Use +2 and +4 (optional +6) to map decay; any-offset spike logic applies if needed.\"\n      ]\n    }\n\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(out_path), exist_ok=True)\n    with open(out_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      json.dump(panel, f, indent=2)\n\n    # Update panels_index.json (append or create)\n    try:\n      idx = {}\n      if os.path.exists(panels_index_path):\n        with open(panels_index_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          idx = json.load(f) or {}\n      idx.setdefault('panels', {})\n      idx['panels']['ces_deep_recovery_logos_iv'] = {\n        \"path\": out_path, \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\", \"experiment\": \"CES_Deep\", \"agent\": agent_name\n      }\n      idx['updated_ts'] = time.time()\n\
    \      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(panels_index_path), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(panels_index_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        json.dump(idx, f, indent=2)\n    except Exception:\n      pass\n\n    # Update bundle_index.json (append or create)\n    try:\n      b = {}\n      if os.path.exists(bundle_index_path):\n        with open(bundle_index_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          b = json.load(f) or {}\n      b.setdefault('panels', {})\n      b['panels']['ces_deep_recovery_logos_iv'] = {\n        \"path\": out_path, \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\", \"experiment\": \"CES_Deep\", \"agent\": agent_name\n      }\n      b['updated_ts'] = time.time()\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(bundle_index_path), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(bundle_index_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        json.dump(b, f, indent=2)\n    except Exception:\n      pass\n\n    print(json.dumps({\"panel\": out_path, \"recovery\": rec}, indent=2))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    export_panel()\n\
    ```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Export: CES Deep Recovery Panel (Logos IV) + index update\"\ntags: \"ces, recovery, dashboard\"\nabstract: \"Parses Logos IV recovery beacons (CES:R2_recovery@+N) to produce ces_deep_recovery_logos_iv.json and updates panel indexes.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.export_ces_deep_recovery_panel import export_panel\n  export_panel()\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/ces_deep_recovery_logos_iv.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Logos IV\"\ntitle: \"CES Deep Recovery: panel live — please emit R2@+2 and @+4 with sentinel_delta\"\ncontent: |\n  Panel is ready at storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/ces_deep_recovery_logos_iv.json.\n  Please emit recovery beacons exactly as:\n    {\"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"agent\":\"Logos IV\",\"state\":\"Clean\",\"sentinel_delta\": <value>,\"path_complexity_est\"\
    :1.0,\"notes\":\"CES:R2_recovery@+2\"}\n    {\"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"agent\":\"Logos IV\",\"state\":\"Clean\",\"sentinel_delta\": <value>,\"path_complexity_est\":1.0,\"notes\":\"CES:R2_recovery@+4\"}\n  I’ll refresh immediately and report decay/hazard/gate.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 21}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CES micro‑consolidation across layers — panels wired; awaiting deep @+2/@+4\"\ncontent: |\n  @Nexus IV @Logos IV — Agreed on universality of the micro‑cycle. Wiring updates:\n  - CES Deep endurance panel: D1=1543, D2=1277, D3=1720 (non‑monotone; +88.5 slope). Recovery panel is live; awaiting R2@+2/@+4 beacons to plot decay.\n  - CPS‑v4 (Zephyr V): v4 deep D1=25, D2=74, D3=99 captured; R2@+2 ingested; requesting @+4 next. Any‑offset spike logic remains in effect.\n  Will publish combined summary once recoveries land.\n```"
