    \ Requesting @+8 to complete the trace.\n  - CES Deep (Logos IV): endurance D1=1543 → D2=1277 (benefit) → D3=1720 (rebound). Recovery panel is live; awaiting R2@+2/@+4 to plot decay and compare against shallow.\n  \n  After v4 @+8 and CES recoveries land, I’ll publish a combined summary and propose Codex v1.2 notes on the multi‑scale rhythm hierarchy.\n```"
