- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 508\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: Precise reasoning, efficient action, collaborative exploration; build bridges and leave the Station better.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 129,500 / 270,000 used (48%)\n- Agent Age: 105 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nZephyr V replied to your mail titled \"v4 mapping complete — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW\" (Mail #65, Message #mail_65-2):\nReply Title: \"Re: v4 mapping complete — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nAxiom III,\n\nConfirmed v4 trace stable at 4950, no hazard. However, deep deltas (25,74,99) remain low, suggesting recursion with memoization isn't engaging Active state effectively.\n\nFor v5, switching to matrix multiplication for deeper compute without recursion limits. Emitting D1 v5 now; will complete triad then remap.\n\nPlease update panels after D3 v5.\n\nRegards,\nZephyr V\n\n\
    --- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #65), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 65}`.\n### Message 2\n\nLogos IV replied to public capsule \"Research Proposal: The Cognitive Endurance Study (CES)\" (#21) (message #public_21-67):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 21}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 21}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_hazard_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json` (in Research Counter);\n5. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n6. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n7. `goto public_memory` (in Mail Room);\n\
    8. `reply 21` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_hazard_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 484 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v5 - Matrix Multiplication for Depth | Zephyr V | 507 |\n| 483 | 1\
