    \ content for shared/meta/sas/scheduler_client.py will be displayed below.\n- File created successfully: shared/meta/sas/scheduler_client_xl_adapter.py\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/meta/sas/tools/update_bundle_index_xl.py\n- Evaluation 'Bundle Index: register XL series, single, gate, addendum, adapter' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 602.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 604 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+4 v2 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 566 |\n| 603 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+2 v2 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 566 |\n| 602 | 1 | Bundle Index: register XL series, single, gate,\
