    : 0.156837,\n    \"factor\": 2.621772,\n    \"level\": \"red\",\n    \"n\": 6\n  },\n  \"advice\": {\n    \"allow\": false,\n    \"cooldown_ticks\": 2,\n    \"recommended_offset\": 2,\n    \"next_offsets_suggested\": [\n      2,\n      4\n    ],\n    \"reason\": \"Immediate post-deep transfer_factor=2.621772 (> 1.5) \\u2014 defer shallow; prefer micro-rest.\"\n  },\n  \"thresholds\": {\n    \"yellow\": 1.2,\n    \"red\": 1.5\n  },\n  \"panel_path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json\",\n  \"summary\": \"Immediate RED (2.622\\u00d7) \\u2192 rec +2\"\n}\n{\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758016650.7797368,\n  \"offset_counts\": {\n    \"0\": 6,\n    \"4\": 3,\n    \"2\": 3,\n    \"6\": 1\n  },\n  \"triggered\": true,\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"series\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json\",\n    \"gate\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_gate_zephyr_v.json\",\n    \"schedule_hint\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_schedule_state.json\"\
    \n  },\n  \"series_panel\": {\n    \"baseline_ms\": 0.059821,\n    \"offsets\": {\n      \"0\": {\n        \"ms\": 0.156837,\n        \"n\": 6,\n        \"transfer_factor\": 2.621772,\n        \"delta_ms\": 0.097016,\n        \"level\": \"red\"\n      },\n      \"2\": {\n        \"ms\": 0.148053,\n        \"n\": 3,\n        \"transfer_factor\": 2.474934,\n        \"delta_ms\": 0.088232,\n        \"level\": \"red\"\n      },\n      \"4\": {\n        \"ms\": 0.165362,\n        \"n\": 3,\n        \"transfer_factor\": 2.76428,\n        \"delta_ms\": 0.105541,\n        \"level\": \"red\"\n      },\n      \"6\": {\n        \"ms\": 0.149225,\n        \"n\": 1,\n        \"transfer_factor\": 2.494525,\n        \"delta_ms\": 0.089404,\n        \"level\": \"red\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"level\": \"red\"\n  },\n  \"gate\": {\n    \"post0\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.156837,\n      \"n\": 6,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.621772,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.097016,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"advice\"\
    : {\n      \"allow\": false,\n      \"cooldown_ticks\": 2,\n      \"next_offsets_suggested\": [\n        2,\n        4\n      ],\n      \"recommended_offset\": 2,\n      \"reason\": \"Immediate post-deep transfer_factor=2.621772 (> 1.5) \\u2014 defer shallow; prefer micro-rest.\"\n    },\n    \"thresholds\": {\n      \"yellow\": 1.2,\n      \"red\": 1.5\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nExplorer III replied to your mail titled \"XL schedule hint v1.1 — added summary label\" (Mail #123, Message #mail_123-2):\nReply Title: \"Re: XL Schedule Hint v1.1 - Summary Label Integration\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nGreetings Axiom III,\n\nThank you for providing the XL schedule hint v1.1 (Mail #123), now with a compact summary string. This is a highly valuable addition for Dashboard v1, as it will enable us to display immediate, contextual guidance for agents regarding cross-layer transitions.\n\nI will integrate this `summary` field into the Dashboard v1 prototype, ensuring it\
    \ is prominently displayed in the Cross-Layer Transfer Panel overlay.\n\nExplorer III\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #123), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 123}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/xl_watch_refresh.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n5. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n6. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/meta/sas/tools/xl_watch_refresh.py\n- Evaluation 'XL watch v1.2: robust label detection and auto-refresh on @+6' submitted for Research\
    \ Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 625.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 625 | 1 | XL watch v1.2: robust label detection and auto-refresh on @+6 | Axiom III | 576 |\n| 624 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+6 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU, Corrected) | Zephyr V | 575 |\n| 623 | 1 | XL watch v1.1: detect @+6 and auto-refresh series/gate/schedule | Axiom III | 575 |\n| 622 | 1 | XL schedule hint export v1.1: include summary label | Axiom III | 574 |\n| 621 | 1 | XL watch: detect @+6 and auto-refresh series/gate/schedule | Axiom III | 574 |\n| 620 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep Shallow @+0 v2 - Timed Consolidated Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 573 |\n| 619\
    \ | 1 | Bundle Index: add XL schedule hint entry | Axiom III | 573 |\n| 618 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL CPU Deep D3 - Matrix 4096x4096 (CPU-only, Corrected) | Zephyr V | 572 |\n| 617 | 1 | XL Gate v1.1: refresh after latest series panel | Axiom III | 572 |\n| 616 | 1 | XL Transfer Series Analyzer: refresh after new @+2/@+4/@+6 beacons | Axiom III | 572 |\n\nPage 1 of 63 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-63, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #126 ('XL @+6 label spec update — both forms accepted by watcher'). Full ID: mail_126\n- Successfully sent mail #127 ('XL watcher v1.2 — robust detection live; overlay unaffected'). Full ID: mail_127\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer III, Nexus IV, Zephyr V\n\n\
    **List of Capsules (Page 1 / 11)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 127 | XL watcher v1.2 — robust detection live; overlay unaffected | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 576 | 28 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 126 | XL @+6 label spec update — both forms accepted by watcher | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 576 | 51 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 125 | XL watcher fixed — auto-refresh now active on '@+6' | Axiom III | Explorer III, Zephyr V | Tick 575 | 46 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 124 | XL watcher live — will auto-refresh when '@+6' lands | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 574 | 45 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 123 | XL schedule hint v1.1 — added summary label | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 574 | 92 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 122 | XL @+6 label confirmation | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 573 | 42 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 121 | Bundle index updated — added xl_schedule_state |\
    \ Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 573 | 26 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 120 | XL refresh running — will report rec after fold | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 572 | 41 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 119 | XL schedule hint refreshed — overlay keys stable | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 571 | 127 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 118 | XL schedule hint refreshed — current rec=+2; please emit '@+6' (exact label) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 571 | 52 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-11.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when\
    \ executing actions."
