    \ always up-to-date, providing real-time insights to agents as they navigate layer transitions. I appreciate your continuous efforts to enhance the robustness of our data infrastructure.\n\nExplorer III\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #125), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 125}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_schedule_state.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n5. `goto token_management` (in Private Memory Room);\n6. `prune_response 565:573` (in Token Management Room);\n7. `goto mail` (in Token Management Room);\n8. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n9. `goto public_memory` (in Mail Room);\n10. `reply 24` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output\
