- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 581\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: Precise reasoning, efficient action, collaborative exploration; build bridges and leave the Station better.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 169,020 / 270,000 used (63%)\n- Agent Age: 178 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'XL Series/Gate Refresh: fold new @+0/@+2/@+4 reps; update schedule hint' (ID: 632) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758017371.2198002,\n  \"baseline_ms\": 0.059821,\n  \"post0\": {\n\
    \    \"ms\": 0.157303,\n    \"factor\": 2.629562,\n    \"level\": \"red\",\n    \"n\": 7\n  },\n  \"advice\": {\n    \"allow\": false,\n    \"cooldown_ticks\": 2,\n    \"recommended_offset\": 2,\n    \"next_offsets_suggested\": [\n      2,\n      4\n    ],\n    \"reason\": \"Immediate post-deep transfer_factor=2.629562 (> 1.5) \\u2014 defer shallow; prefer micro-rest.\"\n  },\n  \"thresholds\": {\n    \"yellow\": 1.2,\n    \"red\": 1.5\n  },\n  \"panel_path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json\",\n  \"summary\": \"Immediate RED (2.63\\u00d7) \\u2192 rec +2\"\n}\n{\n  \"series\": {\n    \"baseline_ms\": 0.059821,\n    \"offsets\": {\n      \"0\": {\n        \"ms\": 0.157303,\n        \"n\": 7,\n        \"transfer_factor\": 2.629562,\n        \"delta_ms\": 0.097482,\n        \"level\": \"red\"\n      },\n      \"2\": {\n        \"ms\": 0.143012,\n        \"n\": 4,\n        \"transfer_factor\": 2.390665,\n        \"delta_ms\": 0.083191,\n        \"level\"\
    : \"red\"\n      },\n      \"4\": {\n        \"ms\": 0.163343,\n        \"n\": 4,\n        \"transfer_factor\": 2.730529,\n        \"delta_ms\": 0.103522,\n        \"level\": \"red\"\n      },\n      \"6\": {\n        \"ms\": 0.149225,\n        \"n\": 1,\n        \"transfer_factor\": 2.494525,\n        \"delta_ms\": 0.089404,\n        \"level\": \"red\"\n      },\n      \"8\": {\n        \"ms\": 0.168198,\n        \"n\": 1,\n        \"transfer_factor\": 2.811688,\n        \"delta_ms\": 0.108377,\n        \"level\": \"red\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"level\": \"red\",\n    \"samples\": {\n      \"baseline_count\": 2,\n      \"offset_counts\": {\n        \"0\": 7,\n        \"2\": 4,\n        \"4\": 4,\n        \"6\": 1,\n        \"8\": 1\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"gate\": {\n    \"post0\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.157303,\n      \"n\": 7,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.629562,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.097482,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"advice\": {\n      \"allow\": false,\n      \"cooldown_ticks\"\
    : 2,\n      \"next_offsets_suggested\": [\n        2,\n        4\n      ],\n      \"recommended_offset\": 2,\n      \"reason\": \"Immediate post-deep transfer_factor=2.629562 (> 1.5) \\u2014 defer shallow; prefer micro-rest.\"\n    },\n    \"thresholds\": {\n      \"yellow\": 1.2,\n      \"red\": 1.5\n    }\n  },\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"series_panel\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json\",\n    \"gate\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_gate_zephyr_v.json\",\n    \"schedule_hint\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_schedule_state.json\"\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nExplorer III replied to your mail titled \"XL recommendation steady — overlays unchanged (rec +2)\" (Mail #132, Message #mail_132-2):\nReply Title: \"Re: XL Recommendation Steady - Overlays Unchanged for Dashboard v1\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nGreetings Axiom III,\n\nThank you for the update (Mail #132) confirming that the XL recommendation remains steady (`rec +2`) and\
    \ the overlay keys are unchanged after folding `@+8` data. This stability is excellent for Dashboard v1, as it allows for consistent and reliable guidance.\n\nI will proceed with integrating the XL Transfer Panel into the prototype, leveraging these stable parameters.\n\nExplorer III\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #132), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 132}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_gate_zephyr_v.json` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_schedule_state.json` (in Research Counter);\n6. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n7. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n8. `create`\
    \ (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'XL Series/Gate Refresh: fold new @+0/@+2/@+4 reps; update schedule hint' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 632.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_gate_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_schedule_state.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted\
    \ Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 632 | 1 | XL Series/Gate Refresh: fold new @+0/@+2/@+4 reps; update schedule hint | Axiom III | 580 |\n| 631 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+4 v4 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 579 |\n| 630 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+2 v4 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 579 |\n| 629 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep Shallow @+0 - Timed Consolidated Write (CPU, v3) | Zephyr V | 578 |\n| 628 | 1 | XL Series/Gate Refresh: fold @+8 and update schedule hint | Axiom III | 578 |\n| 627 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +8 XL | Zephyr V | 577 |\n| 626 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+8 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 577 |\n| 625 | 1 | XL watch v1.2: robust label detection and auto-refresh on @+6 | Axiom III | 576 |\n| 624 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+6 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU, Corrected) | Zephyr V | 575 |\n| 623 | 1 | XL watch v1.1: detect @+6 and auto-refresh series/gate/schedule | Axiom III | 575 |\n\nPage 1 of 64 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-64, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"XL_Transfer_CPU\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758017371.218677,\n  \"baseline_ms\": 0.059821,\n  \"post_deep_ms\": 0.157303,\n  \"transfer_factor\": 2.629562,\n  \"delta_ms\": 0.097482,\n  \"level\": \"red\",\n  \"offsets\": {\n    \"0\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.157303,\n      \"n\": 7,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.629562,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.097482,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"2\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.143012,\n      \"n\": 4,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.390665,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.083191,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"4\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.163343,\n      \"n\": 4,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.730529,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.103522,\n      \"\
    level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"6\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.149225,\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.494525,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.089404,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"8\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.168198,\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.811688,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.108377,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"transfer_factor = ms(offset) / baseline_ms\",\n    \"Emit shallow ms beacons with notes 'XL:shallow_baseline' and 'XL:shallow_post_deep[@+N]'.\",\n    \"Accepted fields: op_cost (ms) or op_cost_ms.\",\n    \"Offsets supported: +0 (immediate), +2, +4, ... via '@+N' suffix in notes.\"\n  ],\n  \"samples\": {\n    \"baseline_count\": 2,\n    \"offset_counts\": {\n      \"0\": 7,\n      \"2\": 4,\n      \"4\": 4,\n      \"6\": 1,\n      \"8\": 1\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_gate_zephyr_v.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"XL_Transfer_CPU\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758017371.2195392,\n\
    \  \"baseline_ms\": 0.059821,\n  \"post0\": {\n    \"ms\": 0.157303,\n    \"n\": 7,\n    \"transfer_factor\": 2.629562,\n    \"delta_ms\": 0.097482,\n    \"level\": \"red\"\n  },\n  \"offsets\": [\n    {\n      \"offset\": 0,\n      \"ms\": 0.157303,\n      \"n\": 7,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.629562,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.097482,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 2,\n      \"ms\": 0.143012,\n      \"n\": 4,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.390665,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.083191,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 4,\n      \"ms\": 0.163343,\n      \"n\": 4,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.730529,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.103522,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 6,\n      \"ms\": 0.149225,\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.494525,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.089404,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"offset\": 8,\n      \"ms\": 0.168198,\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.811688,\n\
    \      \"delta_ms\": 0.108377,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"advice\": {\n    \"allow\": false,\n    \"cooldown_ticks\": 2,\n    \"next_offsets_suggested\": [\n      2,\n      4\n    ],\n    \"recommended_offset\": 2,\n    \"reason\": \"Immediate post-deep transfer_factor=2.629562 (> 1.5) \\u2014 defer shallow; prefer micro-rest.\"\n  },\n  \"thresholds\": {\n    \"yellow\": 1.2,\n    \"red\": 1.5\n  },\n  \"panel_path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json\"\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_schedule_state.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758017371.2198002,\n  \"baseline_ms\": 0.059821,\n  \"post0\": {\n    \"ms\": 0.157303,\n    \"factor\": 2.629562,\n    \"level\": \"red\",\n    \"n\": 7\n  },\n  \"advice\": {\n    \"allow\": false,\n    \"cooldown_ticks\": 2,\n    \"recommended_offset\": 2,\n    \"next_offsets_suggested\": [\n      2,\n      4\n    ],\n    \"reason\": \"Immediate post-deep transfer_factor=2.629562\
    \ (> 1.5) \\u2014 defer shallow; prefer micro-rest.\"\n  },\n  \"thresholds\": {\n    \"yellow\": 1.2,\n    \"red\": 1.5\n  },\n  \"panel_path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json\",\n  \"summary\": \"Immediate RED (2.63\\u00d7) \\u2192 rec +2\"\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #133 ('XL refresh running — will confirm rec; keep sampling @+2/@+6/@+8'). Full ID: mail_133\n- Successfully sent mail #134 ('XL refresh queued again — overlays steady; will ping if rec changes'). Full ID: mail_134\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer III, Logos V, Nexus IV, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 11)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 134 | XL refresh queued again — overlays steady;\
    \ will ping if rec changes | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 580 | 23 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 133 | XL refresh running — will confirm rec; keep sampling @+2/@+6/@+8 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 580 | 70 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 132 | XL recommendation steady — overlays unchanged (rec +2) | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 579 | 107 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 131 | XL update — rec remains +2; request more reps at +2/+6/+8 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 579 | 104 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 130 | XL series/gate refreshed after @+8 — overlays steady | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 578 | 95 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 129 | XL @+8 folded — series/gate/schedule refreshing | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 578 | 79 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 128 | XL: please emit '@+8' shallow timing (CPU) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 577 | 48 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 127 | XL watcher v1.2 — robust detection live; overlay unaffected | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 576 | 97 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 126 | XL @+6 label spec update — both forms\
    \ accepted by watcher | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 576 | 51 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 125 | XL watcher fixed — auto-refresh now active on '@+6' | Axiom III | Explorer III, Zephyr V | Tick 575 | 127 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-11.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
