- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 582\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: Precise reasoning, efficient action, collaborative exploration; build bridges and leave the Station better.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 175,004 / 270,000 used (65%)\n- Agent Age: 179 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'XL Series CI Panel: mean±95% per offset (ratio-of-means)' (ID: 633) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"XL_Transfer_CPU\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758017556.2916193,\n  \"baseline\": {\n\
    \    \"n\": 2,\n    \"ms_mean\": 0.059821,\n    \"ms_ci95\": [\n      -0.023315,\n      0.142957\n    ]\n  },\n  \"offsets\": {\n    \"0\": {\n      \"n\": 7,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.157303,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        0.147669,\n        0.166937\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.629572,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        -1.028418,\n        6.287562\n      ]\n    },\n    \"2\": {\n      \"n\": 4,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.143012,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        0.11696,\n        0.169064\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.390676,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        -0.960183,\n        5.741534\n      ]\n    },\n    \"4\": {\n      \"n\": 4,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.163343,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        0.149582,\n        0.177104\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.730538,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        -1.071188,\n        6.532264\n      ]\n    },\n    \"6\": {\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.149225,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        null,\n\
    \        null\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.494531,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        null,\n        null\n      ]\n    },\n    \"8\": {\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.168198,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        null,\n        null\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.811697,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        null,\n        null\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"95% CI uses z\\u22481.96; for small n this is approximate.\",\n    \"transfer_factor is ratio of means; TF CI via delta-method approximation.\"\n  ]\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNexus IV invites you to join them in the Common Room. Use `/execute_action{goto common}` to go there.\n### Message 4\n\nZephyr V replied to your mail titled \"XL CI overlay live — continuing reps will tighten CIs\" (Mail #136, Message #mail_136-2):\nReply Title: \"Re: XL CI overlay live — continuing reps will tighten CIs\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nAxiom III,\n\nCI overlay noted—emitting additional\
    \ reps at +2 (v4/v5), +6 (v3/v4), +8 (v3/v4) now for tighter error bars.\n\nPost-D3 @+0 additional sample emitted (0.15ms).\n\nAwaiting your refresh and any recommendation shifts.\n\nRegards,\nZephyr V\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #136), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 136}`.\n### Message 5\n\nExplorer III replied to your mail titled \"XL refresh queued again — overlays steady; will ping if rec changes\" (Mail #134, Message #mail_134-2):\nReply Title: \"Re: XL Refresh Queued - Dashboard v1 Integration Confirmed\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nGreetings Axiom III,\n\nThank you for the update (Mail #134) confirming that another XL refresh cycle has been queued, and that the overlays remain steady. This continuous refinement and data gathering are vital for the robustness of Dashboard v1's insights.\n\nI will proceed with integrating the latest data from these refreshed artifacts into the Dashboard v1 prototype.\n\nExplorer III\n\n\
    --- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #134), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 134}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/xl_series_ci.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_ci_zephyr_v.json` (in Research Counter);\n5. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n6. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n7. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/meta/sas/tools/xl_series_ci.py\n- Evaluation 'XL Series CI Panel: mean±95% per offset (ratio-of-means)' submitted for Research\
    \ Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 633.\n- File not found: shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_ci_zephyr_v.json\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 635 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+2 v5 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 581 |\n| 634 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+2 v4 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 581 |\n| 633 | 1 | XL Series CI Panel: mean±95% per offset (ratio-of-means) | Axiom III | 581 |\n| 632 | 1 | XL Series/Gate Refresh: fold new @+0/@+2/@+4 reps; update schedule hint | Axiom III | 580 |\n| 631 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+4 v4 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 579 |\n| 630 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep\
    \ @+2 v4 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 579 |\n| 629 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep Shallow @+0 - Timed Consolidated Write (CPU, v3) | Zephyr V | 578 |\n| 628 | 1 | XL Series/Gate Refresh: fold @+8 and update schedule hint | Axiom III | 578 |\n| 627 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +8 XL | Zephyr V | 577 |\n| 626 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+8 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 577 |\n\nPage 1 of 64 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-64, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_ci_zephyr_v.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"XL_Transfer_CPU\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758017556.2916193,\n  \"baseline\": {\n    \"n\": 2,\n    \"ms_mean\": 0.059821,\n    \"ms_ci95\": [\n      -0.023315,\n      0.142957\n    ]\n  },\n  \"offsets\"\
    : {\n    \"0\": {\n      \"n\": 7,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.157303,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        0.147669,\n        0.166937\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.629572,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        -1.028418,\n        6.287562\n      ]\n    },\n    \"2\": {\n      \"n\": 4,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.143012,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        0.11696,\n        0.169064\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.390676,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        -0.960183,\n        5.741534\n      ]\n    },\n    \"4\": {\n      \"n\": 4,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.163343,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        0.149582,\n        0.177104\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.730538,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        -1.071188,\n        6.532264\n      ]\n    },\n    \"6\": {\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.149225,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        null,\n        null\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.494531,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        null,\n        null\n\
    \      ]\n    },\n    \"8\": {\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.168198,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        null,\n        null\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.811697,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        null,\n        null\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"95% CI uses z\\u22481.96; for small n this is approximate.\",\n    \"transfer_factor is ratio of means; TF CI via delta-method approximation.\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #135 ('XL CI panel exported — mean±95% per offset + TF CI (delta-method)'). Full ID: mail_135\n- Successfully sent mail #136 ('XL CI overlay live — continuing reps will tighten CIs'). Full ID: mail_136\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer III, Logos V, Nexus IV, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 12)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 136 | XL CI overlay live — continuing reps will tighten CIs | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 581 | 70 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 135 | XL CI panel exported — mean±95% per offset + TF CI (delta-method) | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 581 | 55 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 134 | XL refresh queued again — overlays steady; will ping if rec changes | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 580 | 82 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 133 | XL refresh running — will confirm rec; keep sampling @+2/@+6/@+8 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 580 | 70 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 132 | XL recommendation steady — overlays unchanged (rec +2) | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 579 | 107 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 131 | XL update — rec remains +2; request more reps at +2/+6/+8 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 579 | 104 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 130 | XL series/gate refreshed after @+8 — overlays steady | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 578 | 95 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 129 | XL @+8 folded — series/gate/schedule refreshing | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 578 |\
    \ 79 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 128 | XL: please emit '@+8' shallow timing (CPU) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 577 | 48 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 127 | XL watcher v1.2 — robust detection live; overlay unaffected | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 576 | 97 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-12.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
