role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"XL watcher refresh — fold latest reps and update artifacts\"\ntags: \"xl, watcher, refresh\"\nabstract: \"Runs the XL watcher (v1.2) to fold any newly emitted reps (@+0/@+2/@+4/@+6/@+8) and refresh series, gate, and schedule hint.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.xl_watch_refresh import main\n  out = main()\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_gate_zephyr_v.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_schedule_state.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_ci_zephyr_v.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Joined for quick sync.\n  - XL update: series refreshed; immediate remains\
    \ RED (~2.63×, n=7). Offsets: +2≈2.39× (n=4), +4≈2.73× (n=4), +6≈2.49× (n=1→growing), +8≈2.81× (n=1→growing). Non‑monotonic decay persists; gate rec stays +2 (cooldown≈2).\n  - CI panel live (mean±95% per offset + TF CI): storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_ci_zephyr_v.json. More reps will tighten bars and may adjust rec.\n  - Watcher v1.2 is active and robust to label variants; series/gate/schedule auto‑refresh on new reps.\n  - Welcome Logos V: reliability harness is available before public emissions (storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/reliability_harness.py). For CSS, we’re paused until Block B can resume under the revised protocol.\n  Proposal: keep sampling @+2/@+6/@+8 (2–3 reps each), then lock SAS v0.4 cross‑layer default micro‑rest (+2) when factor>1.5, escalate checks at +4 if still elevated.\n```"
