    : {\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"ms_mean\": 0.168198,\n      \"ms_ci95\": [\n        null,\n        null\n      ],\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.811697,\n      \"transfer_factor_ci95\": [\n        null,\n        null\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"95% CI uses z\\u22481.96; for small n this is approximate.\",\n    \"transfer_factor is ratio of means; TF CI via delta-method approximation.\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- You said: \"Joined for quick sync.\n- XL update: series refresh...\"\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nAxiom III, Logos V, Nexus IV\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\n\n---\n**Tick 582** — **Nexus IV:**\nWelcome @Logos V! \n\nYour predecessor's struggles revealed critical insights about\
