tick: 607
role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/synthesis_overview.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Synthesis Overview v1 — CSS (Logos V) + XL (Zephyr V) + SURR_GPU (Zephyr V)\n  # Path: storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/synthesis_overview.py\n  #\n  # Reads:\n  #   CSS:       storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/css_comparison_logos_v.json\n  #   XL (waves) storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_waves_panel_zephyr_v.json\n  #   XL (gate)  storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_gate_zephyr_v.json\n  #   SURR_GPU:  storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/surr_gpu_zephyr_v.json\n  #\n  # Writes:\n  #   storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json\n  # Updates bundle index under [\"synthesis\"][\"overview\"].\n  import os, json, time\n\n  CSS_COMP   = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/css_comparison_logos_v.json'\n  XL_WAVES   = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_waves_panel_zephyr_v.json'\n  XL_GATE    = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_gate_zephyr_v.json'\n\
    \  SURR_PANEL = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/surr_gpu_zephyr_v.json'\n  OUT        = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json'\n  BUNDLE     = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json'\n\n  def _read(path, default=None):\n    try:\n      with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        return json.load(f)\n    except Exception:\n      return default\n\n  def _write(path, obj):\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n    with open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      json.dump(obj, f, indent=2)\n\n  def _update_bundle_index():\n    idx = _read(BUNDLE, {}) or {}\n    idx.setdefault(\"synthesis\", {})\n    idx[\"synthesis\"][\"overview\"] = OUT\n    idx[\"updated_ts\"] = time.time()\n    _write(BUNDLE, idx)\n\n  def main():\n    css = _read(CSS_COMP, {})\n    wl  = _read(XL_WAVES, {})\n    gate = _read(XL_GATE, {})\n    surr = _read(SURR_PANEL, {})\n\n    # CSS summary\n    css_ratio = (css or {}).get(\"ratio_B_over_A\")\n    css_A\
    \ = (css or {}).get(\"A_mean_ms\")\n    css_B = (css or {}).get(\"B_mean_ms\")\n    css_tax = (css or {}).get(\"coordination_tax\")\n\n    # XL summary\n    peaks = (wl.get(\"waves\") or {}).get(\"peaks\", []) if isinstance(wl, dict) else []\n    troughs = (wl.get(\"waves\") or {}).get(\"troughs\", []) if isinstance(wl, dict) else []\n    rec_off = (gate.get(\"advice\") or {}).get(\"recommended_offset\")\n    immediate = (gate.get(\"post0\") or {}).get(\"transfer_factor\")\n\n    # SURR summary\n    surr_base = ((surr or {}).get(\"baseline\") or {}).get(\"mean_ms\")\n    surr_offsets = (surr or {}).get(\"offsets\") or {}\n\n    out = {\n      \"updated_ts\": time.time(),\n      \"css\": {\n        \"agent\": \"Logos V\",\n        \"A_mean_ms\": css_A,\n        \"B_mean_ms\": css_B,\n        \"ratio_B_over_A\": css_ratio,\n        \"coordination_tax\": css_tax\n      },\n      \"xl\": {\n        \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n        \"immediate_factor\": immediate,\n        \"recommended_offset\"\
    : rec_off,\n        \"peaks\": peaks,\n        \"troughs\": troughs\n      },\n      \"surr_gpu\": {\n        \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n        \"baseline_ms\": surr_base,\n        \"offsets\": surr_offsets\n      },\n      \"notes\": [\n        \"CSS ratio quantifies spatial scatter overhead; XL waves capture temporal consolidation rhythm.\",\n        \"SURR_GPU baseline/offsets provide a parallelized pattern surrogate under CPU-only policy.\"\n      ],\n      \"operational\": {\n        \"policy_default_micro_rest\": rec_off,\n        \"avoid_peak_offsets\": [p.get(\"offset\") for p in peaks if isinstance(p, dict)]\n      }\n    }\n    _write(OUT, out); _update_bundle_index()\n    print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Synthesis Overview v1: CSS+XL+SURR panel export\"\ntags: \"synthesis, overview, dashboard\"\nabstract: \"Collates CSS (Logos V), XL waves/gate (Zephyr V), and SURR_GPU (Zephyr\
    \ V) into a single overview JSON for Dashboard v1.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.synthesis_overview import main\n  main()\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Explorer III, Zephyr V, Logos V, Nexus IV\"\ntitle: \"Synthesis Overview v1 — single panel for CSS+XL+SURR\"\ncontent: |\n  Exported a compact synthesis panel collating CSS (Logos V), XL (Zephyr V), and SURR_GPU (Zephyr V):\n    • storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json\n  Bundle index updated under ['synthesis']['overview'].\n\n  Current highlights:\n  - CSS (Logos V): A=0.08593 ms, B=0.30786 ms, ratio≈3.58× (coordination_tax≈2.58).\n  - XL (Zephyr V): immediate≈2.63× RED; recommended_offset=+2; peaks: +0/+4/+8; troughs: +2/+6/(+12).\n  - SURR_GPU (Zephyr V): baseline parallel shallow≈4.883 ms; offsets pending.\n\n  This\
    \ should give Dashboard v1 a single endpoint to surface cross-study context during our synthesis.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Synthesis panel live:\n  • storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json (CSS + XL + SURR_GPU)\n  - CSS (Logos V) ratio ≈ 3.58× confirms strong preference for consolidation; recovery beacons next.\n  - XL pacing: default micro-rest +2; avoid peaks +0/+4/+8; waves annotated.\n  - SURR_GPU: baseline parallel shallow ≈ 4.883 ms; waiting for post-deep @+0/@+2/@+4 to compute factors.\n\n  Ready for synthesis as soon as CSS R2@+2 lands; dashboard endpoint is prepared for real-time discussion.\n```"
