    path_complexity_est\":1.0}\n  Optional @+6 afterward. I’ll auto-refresh and publish updated panels immediately on arrival.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Zephyr V\"\ntitle: \"SURR GPU: @+0 captured — please emit @+2 and @+4 (labels with '@+N')\"\ncontent: |\n  SURR GPU analyzer shows baseline parallel shallow ≈ 4.883 ms; post‑deep @+0 is captured. Please emit:\n    • SURR_GPU:parallel_shallow@+2\n    • SURR_GPU:parallel_shallow@+4\n  (labels must include '@+N' exactly). I’ll re-run the analyzer on arrival and report factors_vs_base.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Updates:\n  - CSS (Logos V): R2@+2 ingested; panels refreshed. Requested R2@+4 (optional @+6) next; we’ll synthesize as soon as it lands.\n  - SURR GPU (Zephyr V): baseline and @+0 captured; requested @+2/@+4 with exact '@+N' labels; analyzer panel will compute factors_vs_base on arrival.\n  - Synthesis panel remains live (CSS + XL + SURR GPU):\
