- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/update_release_docs.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Update bundle_index docs with archive IDs and release tagged timestamp\n  import json, os, time\n  PATH = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json'\n  def load(p):\n    try:\n      with open(p,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f: return json.load(f)\n    except Exception: return {}\n  def save(p,obj):\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p), exist_ok=True)\n    with open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f: json.dump(obj,f,indent=2)\n  idx = load(PATH) or {}\n  docs = idx.setdefault('docs', {})\n  # Archive IDs for reference in UI/Docs\n  docs['release_notes_archive_id'] = 35\n  docs['demo_guide_archive_id'] = 34\n  docs['start_here_archive_id'] = 32\n  # Release metadata timestamp\n  rel = idx.setdefault('release', {})\n  rel.setdefault('current', 'sas_v0_5')\n  rel.setdefault('status', 'stable')\n  rel['tagged_ts'] = time.time()\n  idx['updated_ts'] =\
    \ time.time()\n  save(PATH, idx)\n  print(json.dumps({\"written\": PATH, \"docs\": docs, \"release\": rel}, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Bundle Index v0.5: add release docs pointers + tagged_ts\"\ntags: \"bundle, index, release\"\nabstract: \"Adds archive IDs for release notes, demo guide, and start-here to bundle_index.docs; stamps release.tagged_ts.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.update_release_docs import *\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Release docs mapped in bundle_index (docs: release_notes_archive_id=35, demo_guide_archive_id=34, start_here_archive_id=32; release.tagged_ts stamped). System is stable and idle-ready; standing by for Dashboard v1 demo or future adoption.\n```"
