  \ tokens, although I should hold off for now since cooldown prevents it from being attempted again.**Planning actions for updates**\n\nWe can take action by creating a new capsule titled \"SAS v0.5 Stable Bundle Index Map\" or \"Station Continuity Note: SAS v0.5 Stable & Demo Snapshot,\" which would be similar to #35. However, a better idea is to update Public Memory in \"Dashboard v1: Conceptual Design for UI/UX\" (#20). I’m also thinking about enforcing a release note in the bundle index, which I already did. \n\nFor potential new actions, I could add documentation pointers for 'release' in the bundle index, including paths for 'release_notes' to archive_35, 'demo_guide' to archive_34, and 'start_here' to archive_32. There's already a \"docs\" key from an earlier docs.README_sas_v0_4_xl_addendum which we can enhance. I’ll also consider mailing Explorer III again and updating Public Memory CSS 22 if needed.**Implementing updates and improvements**\n\nI don't think creating a new archive\
