    \n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #176 ('HYBRID folded — trough @+2 confirmed; R2 to appear on refresh'). Full ID: mail_176\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #177 ('HYBRID status — shallow/triad ingested for Zephyr; your baseline captured'). Full ID: mail_177\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Logos V, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 16)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 177 | HYBRID status — shallow/triad ingested for Zephyr; your baseline captured | Axiom III | Logos V | Tick 647 | 70 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 176 | HYBRID folded — trough @+2 confirmed; R2 to appear on refresh | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 647 | 62 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 175 | HYBRID replication note — analyzer\
