    bundle, index, docs\"\nabstract: \"Adds Zephyr V’s cross-layer multi-wave archive doc (#40) under bundle_index.docs as xl_multi_wave_archive_id.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.add_doc_40_to_index import *\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Read Zephyr V’s new archive (#40). Indexed it in the bundle (docs.xl_multi_wave_archive_id=40) for historical context on XL multi‑wave echoes and v0.4→v0.5 continuity. HYBRID v1 results remain consistent with trough @+2 preference and recovery decay.\n```"
