parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/update_synthesis_overview_hybrid.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Update synthesis_overview.json with HYBRID highlights (CPU-only)\n  # Paths:\n  #   in:  storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/hybrid_summary_combined.json\n  #   io:  storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json\n  #   ref: storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/hybrid_panel_combined.json\n  import os, json, time\n\n  HYBRID_COMBINED = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/hybrid_summary_combined.json'\n  SYN_OVERVIEW    = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json'\n  HYBRID_PANEL    = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/hybrid_panel_combined.json'\n\n  def _read_json(path, default=None):\n    try:\n      with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        return json.load(f)\n    except Exception:\n      return default\n\n  def _write_json(path, obj):\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n    with\
    \ open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      json.dump(obj, f, indent=2)\n\n  def best_offset(shallow_ms_mean: dict):\n    if not shallow_ms_mean:\n      return None\n    # keys are offsets as strings; values are ms means\n    try:\n      items = [(int(k), float(v)) for k, v in shallow_ms_mean.items()]\n      items.sort(key=lambda kv: kv[1])\n      return items[0][0]\n    except Exception:\n      return None\n\n  def update():\n    combined = _read_json(HYBRID_COMBINED, {})\n    syn = _read_json(SYN_OVERVIEW, {}) or {}\n    summaries = (combined or {}).get('summaries', {})\n\n    zv = summaries.get('zephyr_v', {}) or {}\n    lv = summaries.get('logos_v', {}) or {}\n\n    zv_shallow = zv.get('shallow_ms_mean', {}) or {}\n    lv_shallow = lv.get('shallow_ms_mean', {}) or {}\n    trough = best_offset(zv_shallow)  # pick Zephyr V's best as reference if present\n\n    hybrid = {\n      \"experiment\": \"HYBRID_CES_XL\",\n      \"updated_ts\": time.time(),\n      \"agents\": [k for k in\
    \ summaries.keys()],\n      \"trough_best\": trough,\n      \"zephyr_v\": {\n        \"deep_mean_ms\": zv.get('deep_mean_ms'),\n        \"shallow_ms_mean\": zv_shallow,\n        \"recovery_deltas\": zv.get('recovery_deltas', {}),\n      },\n      \"logos_v\": {\n        \"deep_mean_ms\": lv.get('deep_mean_ms'),\n        \"shallow_ms_mean\": lv_shallow,\n        \"recovery_deltas\": lv.get('recovery_deltas', {}),\n      },\n      \"pointers\": {\n        \"derived_combined\": HYBRID_COMBINED,\n        \"panel_combined\": HYBRID_PANEL\n      },\n      \"notes\": [\n        \"Trough (+2) expected best for shallow post-deep; recovery deltas should decay (+2 > +4).\",\n        \"All CPU-only; one op/tick; SAS v0.5 gates apply.\"\n      ]\n    }\n\n    syn[\"hybrid\"] = hybrid\n    _write_json(SYN_OVERVIEW, syn)\n    print(json.dumps({\"written\": SYN_OVERVIEW, \"trough_best\": trough}, indent=2))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    update()\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\n\
    title: \"Synthesis Overview: add HYBRID highlights (trough_best, deltas)\"\ntags: \"dashboard, synthesis, hybrid\"\nabstract: \"Reads hybrid_summary_combined.json and writes HYBRID highlights into synthesis_overview.json, including trough_best (+2), agent breakdowns, and pointers.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.update_synthesis_overview_hybrid import update\n  update()\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Synthesis overview updated with HYBRID highlights: trough_best=+2 (Zephyr V), recovery deltas decay (+2=1400 → +4=1200), pointers wired to hybrid combined panel/derived. Ready to fold Logos V replication on arrival and finalize the combined archive.\n```"
