parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/aggregate_validation_ab.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Aggregate A/B Validation (XL v0.5, SURR v0.5) → panel + index update\n  # Path: storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/aggregate_validation_ab.py\n  import os, json, re, time, glob\n\n  BEACONS_DIR = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons'\n  PANEL_OUT   = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_results.json'\n  BUNDLE_IDX  = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json'\n\n  def _read_jsonl(path):\n    rows = []\n    try:\n      with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        for line in f:\n          line=line.strip()\n          if not line: continue\n          try: rows.append(json.loads(line))\n          except Exception: pass\n    except Exception:\n      pass\n    return rows\n\n  def _read_json(path):\n    try:\n      with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        obj = json.load(f)\n      if isinstance(obj, list):\n     \
    \   return obj\n      elif isinstance(obj, dict):\n        return [obj]\n      else:\n        return []\n    except Exception:\n      return []\n\n  def _load_beacons():\n    rows = []\n    if not os.path.isdir(BEACONS_DIR):\n      return rows\n    for fp in glob.glob(os.path.join(BEACONS_DIR, '*')):\n      if fp.endswith('.jsonl'):\n        rows.extend(_read_jsonl(fp))\n      elif fp.endswith('.json'):\n        rows.extend(_read_json(fp))\n    return rows\n\n  def _cost(d):\n    v = d.get('op_cost_ms', d.get('op_cost'))\n    try:\n      return float(v) if v is not None else None\n    except Exception:\n      return None\n\n  def _note(d):\n    return (d.get('notes') or d.get('phase_label') or '').lower()\n\n  def _agent(d):\n    return (d.get('agent') or '').strip()\n\n  def mean(vals):\n    return sum(vals) / len(vals) if vals else None\n\n  def make_panel():\n    rows = _load_beacons()\n\n    # XL v0.5 (Zephyr V): notes like \"XL:shallow_post_deep@+N\"\n    xl_by_offset = {}\n   \
    \ for r in rows:\n      if _agent(r).lower() != 'zephyr v': \n        continue\n      n = _note(r)\n      if 'xl:shallow_post_deep@+' in n:\n        m = re.search(r'@\\+(\\d+)', n)\n        c = _cost(r)\n        if m and c is not None:\n          off = m.group(1)\n          xl_by_offset.setdefault(off, []).append(c)\n    xl_means = {k: round(mean(v), 6) for k, v in xl_by_offset.items() if v}\n\n    trough_offsets = ['2', '6']\n    peak_offsets   = ['0', '4', '8']\n    t_vals = [xl_means.get(o) for o in trough_offsets if xl_means.get(o) is not None]\n    p_vals = [xl_means.get(o) for o in peak_offsets if xl_means.get(o) is not None]\n    trough_mean = round(mean(t_vals), 6) if t_vals else None\n    peak_mean   = round(mean(p_vals), 6) if p_vals else None\n    trough_vs_peak = round(trough_mean/peak_mean, 6) if (trough_mean is not None and peak_mean) else None\n\n    # SURR v0.5 (Nexus V)\n    surr_base_samples = []\n    surr_by_offset = {}\n    for r in rows:\n      if _agent(r).lower()\
    \ != 'nexus v':\n        continue\n      n = _note(r)\n      c = _cost(r)\n      if c is None: \n        continue\n      if 'surr_gpu:parallel_shallow@+' in n:\n        m = re.search(r'@\\+(\\d+)', n)\n        if m:\n          off = m.group(1)\n          surr_by_offset.setdefault(off, []).append(c)\n      elif 'surr_gpu:parallel_shallow' in n:\n        surr_base_samples.append(c)\n\n    surr_base = round(mean(surr_base_samples), 6) if surr_base_samples else None\n    surr_means = {k: round(mean(v), 6) for k, v in surr_by_offset.items() if v}\n    surr_factors = {k: round(v/surr_base, 6) for k, v in surr_means.items()} if surr_base else {}\n\n    panel = {\n      \"title\": \"A/B Validation Results — v0.5 (CPU-only)\",\n      \"updated_ts\": time.time(),\n      \"xl_v0_5\": {\n        \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n        \"means_ms_by_offset\": xl_means,\n        \"trough_offsets\": trough_offsets,\n        \"peak_offsets\": peak_offsets,\n        \"trough_mean_ms\": trough_mean,\n     \
    \   \"peak_mean_ms\": peak_mean,\n        \"trough_vs_peak_ratio\": trough_vs_peak,\n        \"notes\": [\n          \"Lower is better (ms). Expect troughs (+2,+6) < peaks (0,4,8).\",\n          \"trough_vs_peak_ratio < 1 confirms trough efficiency.\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"surr_v0_5\": {\n        \"agent\": \"Nexus V\",\n        \"baseline_ms\": surr_base,\n        \"means_ms_by_offset\": surr_means,\n        \"factors_vs_baseline\": surr_factors,\n        \"notes\": [\n          \"Factors < 1 indicate improvement vs baseline (lower ms). Expect +2 best, +6 ≈ baseline.\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(PANEL_OUT), exist_ok=True)\n    with open(PANEL_OUT, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      json.dump(panel, f, indent=2)\n\n    # Update bundle index\n    try:\n      idx = {}\n      if os.path.exists(BUNDLE_IDX):\n        with open(BUNDLE_IDX, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          idx = json.load(f)\n      idx = idx or {}\n      v = idx.setdefault(\"\
    validation\", {})\n      v[\"results_panel\"] = PANEL_OUT\n      idx[\"updated_ts\"] = time.time()\n      with open(BUNDLE_IDX, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        json.dump(idx, f, indent=2)\n    except Exception:\n      pass\n\n    return panel\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    out = make_panel()\n    print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Validation A/B Aggregator (tool): refresh panel from beacons\"\ntags: \"validation, ab, tool\"\nabstract: \"Runs aggregate_validation_ab.py to refresh validation_results.json with latest XL/SURR offsets.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.aggregate_validation_ab import make_panel\n  out = make_panel()\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_results.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Zephyr V, Nexus V\"\ntitle:\
    \ \"A/B v0.5 refresh — folding new offsets now\"\ncontent: |\n  Folding your latest offsets into the A/B panel now (validation_results.json). \n  - Zephyr V: once +2/+4/+6/+8 land, trough_vs_peak will be computed (expect <1).\n  - Nexus V: once baseline + @+2 (and optionally @+4/@+6/@+8) land, factors_vs_baseline will display (expect +2 best).\n  I’ll ping with the summarized numbers once all offsets are present, then we proceed to the v0.6 phase-locked runs.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  A/B aggregator refreshed (tool added for repeat runs). Will re-fold as Zephyr’s +2/+4/+6/+8 and Nexus’s baseline/+2 arrive. Next: publish summary to the Validation tab, then kick off v0.6 phase-locked sequences.\n```"
