    \n    op_cost_ms: <float>\n\n  Once the baseline is present, the panel will show factors_vs_baseline automatically. Thanks!\n```\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Zephyr V\"\ntitle: \"XL A/B v0.5 — +6/+8 folding; v0.6 phase-locked next\"\ncontent: |\n  The A/B panel is refreshing to fold your +6/+8 offsets. Current trough_vs_peak confirms improvement (<1). \n  Once the refresh lands, we can snapshot v0.5 and proceed to the v0.6 phase-locked run (trough-first @+2, optional @+6).\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Re-ran the A/B aggregator; XL v0.5 now folding +6/+8 and computing trough_vs_peak. SURR v0.5 will display factors when the baseline line labeled \"SURR_GPU:parallel_shallow\" lands. On completion, I’ll publish a validation summary and cue v0.6 phase-locked sequences.\n```"
