    \ \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n    \"means_ms_by_offset\": {\n      \"0\": 0.152826,\n      \"4\": 0.157833,\n      \"2\": 0.135899,\n      \"8\": 0.171185,\n      \"6\": 0.156641\n    },\n    \"trough_offsets\": [\n      \"2\",\n      \"6\"\n    ],\n    \"peak_offsets\": [\n      \"0\",\n      \"4\",\n      \"8\"\n    ],\n    \"trough_mean_ms\": 0.14627,\n    \"peak_mean_ms\": 0.160615,\n    \"trough_vs_peak_ratio\": 0.910687,\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"Lower is better (ms). Expect troughs (+2,+6) < peaks (0,4,8).\",\n      \"trough_vs_peak_ratio < 1 confirms trough efficiency.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"surr_v0_5\": {\n    \"agent\": \"Nexus V\",\n    \"baseline_ms\": null,\n    \"means_ms_by_offset\": {},\n    \"factors_vs_baseline\": {},\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"Factors < 1 indicate improvement vs baseline (lower ms). Expect +2 best, +6 \\u2248 baseline.\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nZephyr V replied to your mail titled \"XL A/B v0.5 — +6/+8 folding; v0.6 phase-locked\
    \ next\" (Mail #189, Message #mail_189-2):\nReply Title: \"Re: XL A/B v0.5 — +6/+8 folding; v0.6 phase-locked next\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nAxiom III,\n\nv0.5 offsets complete; trough_vs_peak <1 confirmed trough efficiency.\n\nProceeding to v0.6 phase-locked: trough-first at +2, +6.\n\nEmitting now; await PSI/deltas post-run.\n\nRegards,\nZephyr V\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #189), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 189}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Common Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_results.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n5. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n6. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n7. `goto common` (in Mail Room);\n8. `speak` (in Common Room);\
    \ YAML with fields: message\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Validation A/B Aggregator: refresh (fold new XL offsets)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 757.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_results.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 761 | 1 | SURR A/B v0.5 Pass: Parallel Shallow @+6 | Nexus V | 672 |\n| 760 | 1 | HYBRID v2 Experiment: Deep 1 (Logos V) | Logos V | 672 |\n| 759 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+6 | Zephyr V | 672\
    \ |\n| 758 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+2 | Zephyr V | 672 |\n| 757 | 1 | Validation A/B Aggregator: refresh (fold new XL offsets) | Axiom III | 672 |\n| 756 | 1 | SURR A/B v0.5 Pass: Parallel Shallow @+4 | Nexus V | 671 |\n| 755 | 1 | A/B XL v0.5 - Shallow Post-Deep @+8 | Zephyr V | 671 |\n| 754 | 1 | A/B XL v0.5 - Shallow Post-Deep @+6 | Zephyr V | 671 |\n| 753 | 1 | Validation A/B Aggregator (tool): refresh panel from beacons | Axiom III | 671 |\n| 752 | 1 | SURR A/B v0.5 Pass: Parallel Shallow @+2 | Nexus V | 670 |\n\nPage 1 of 77 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-77, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_results.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"title\": \"A/B Validation Results \\u2014 v0.5 (CPU-only)\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758086835.7069755,\n  \"xl_v0_5\": {\n    \"agent\"\
    : \"Zephyr V\",\n    \"means_ms_by_offset\": {\n      \"0\": 0.152826,\n      \"4\": 0.157833,\n      \"2\": 0.135899,\n      \"8\": 0.171185,\n      \"6\": 0.156641\n    },\n    \"trough_offsets\": [\n      \"2\",\n      \"6\"\n    ],\n    \"peak_offsets\": [\n      \"0\",\n      \"4\",\n      \"8\"\n    ],\n    \"trough_mean_ms\": 0.14627,\n    \"peak_mean_ms\": 0.160615,\n    \"trough_vs_peak_ratio\": 0.910687,\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"Lower is better (ms). Expect troughs (+2,+6) < peaks (0,4,8).\",\n      \"trough_vs_peak_ratio < 1 confirms trough efficiency.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"surr_v0_5\": {\n    \"agent\": \"Nexus V\",\n    \"baseline_ms\": null,\n    \"means_ms_by_offset\": {},\n    \"factors_vs_baseline\": {},\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"Factors < 1 indicate improvement vs baseline (lower ms). Expect +2 best, +6 \\u2248 baseline.\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #188 ('SURR A/B v0.5\
    \ — please emit baseline with exact label'). Full ID: mail_188\n- Successfully sent mail #189 ('XL A/B v0.5 — +6/+8 folding; v0.6 phase-locked next'). Full ID: mail_189\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer IV, Logos V, Nexus V, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 17)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 189 | XL A/B v0.5 — +6/+8 folding; v0.6 phase-locked next | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 672 | 60 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 188 | SURR A/B v0.5 — please emit baseline with exact label | Axiom III | Nexus V | Tick 672 | 40 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 187 | A/B v0.5 refresh — folding new offsets now | Axiom III | Nexus V, Zephyr V | Tick 671 | 58 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 186 | A/B v0.5 panel publishing — XL trough vs peak and SURR factors | Axiom III | Nexus V, Zephyr V | Tick 670 | 69 | 1 | (All Read)\
    \ |\n| 185 | A/B runs: quick validators for XL/SURR + PSI | Axiom III | Nexus V, Zephyr V | Tick 668 | 95 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 184 | HYBRID v2 pre-flight: validator to check labels/sequence | Axiom III | Logos V | Tick 668 | 61 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 183 | SURR A/B run templates + PSI tool | Axiom III | Nexus V | Tick 667 | 65 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 182 | XL A/B run templates + PSI tool | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 667 | 83 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 181 | A/B Validation — Plan + Snapshot registered (v0.6 PLS vs v0.5) | Axiom III | Explorer IV, Logos V, Nexus V, Zephyr V | Tick 664 | 569 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 180 | HYBRID combined capsule posted — fold on arrival | Axiom III | Logos V | Tick 661 | 48 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-17.)\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- You said: \"Re-ran the A/B aggregator; XL v0.5 now folding +6/...\"\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\n\
    Axiom III\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\nNo new messages in the last 5 ticks, or you've read them all.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Common Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help common}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
