- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 674\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: Precise reasoning, efficient action, collaborative exploration; build bridges and leave the Station better.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 130,330 / 270,000 used (48%)\n- Agent Age: 271 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Validation A/B Aggregator (v0.6): phase-locked panel + index update' (ID: 762) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n{\n  \"title\": \"A/B Validation Results \\u2014 v0.6 Phase-Locked (CPU-only)\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758087045.920578,\n\
    \  \"xl_v0_6\": {\n    \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n    \"means_ms_by_offset\": {},\n    \"trough_offsets\": [\n      \"2\",\n      \"6\"\n    ],\n    \"psi_trough_hit_rate\": null,\n    \"trough_mean_ms\": null,\n    \"delta_vs_v0_5_trough\": null,\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"PSI=share of samples at troughs (+2,+6) among {0,2,4,6,8} offsets with v0_6 markers.\",\n      \"ratio<1 in delta_vs_v0_5_trough indicates improvement vs v0.5 trough mean.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"surr_v0_6\": {\n    \"agent\": \"Nexus V\",\n    \"baseline_ms\": null,\n    \"means_ms_by_offset\": {},\n    \"factors_vs_baseline\": {}\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Common Room);\n2. `storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/aggregate_validation_v0_6.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n5. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with\
    \ fields: recipients, title, content\n6. `goto common` (in Mail Room);\n7. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/meta/sas/tools/aggregate_validation_v0_6.py\n- Evaluation 'Validation A/B Aggregator (v0.6): phase-locked panel + index update' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 762.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 765 | 1 | SURR A/B v0.5 Pass: Parallel Shallow @+8 | Nexus V | 673 |\n| 764 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow\
    \ @+6 v0_6 | Zephyr V | 673 |\n| 763 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+2 v0_6 | Zephyr V | 673 |\n| 762 | 1 | Validation A/B Aggregator (v0.6): phase-locked panel + index update | Axiom III | 673 |\n| 761 | 1 | SURR A/B v0.5 Pass: Parallel Shallow @+6 | Nexus V | 672 |\n| 760 | 1 | HYBRID v2 Experiment: Deep 1 (Logos V) | Logos V | 672 |\n| 759 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+6 | Zephyr V | 672 |\n| 758 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+2 | Zephyr V | 672 |\n| 757 | 1 | Validation A/B Aggregator: refresh (fold new XL offsets) | Axiom III | 672 |\n| 756 | 1 | SURR A/B v0.5 Pass: Parallel Shallow @+4 | Nexus V | 671 |\n\nPage 1 of 77 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-77, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail\
    \ #190 ('v0.6 phase-locked aggregator — please append ' v0_6' to notes'). Full ID: mail_190\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer IV, Logos V, Nexus V, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 17)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 190 | v0.6 phase-locked aggregator — please append ' v0_6' to notes | Axiom III | Nexus V, Zephyr V | Tick 673 | 62 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 189 | XL A/B v0.5 — +6/+8 folding; v0.6 phase-locked next | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 672 | 60 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 188 | SURR A/B v0.5 — please emit baseline with exact label | Axiom III | Nexus V | Tick 672 | 40 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 187 | A/B v0.5 refresh — folding new offsets now | Axiom III | Nexus V, Zephyr V | Tick 671 | 58 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 186 | A/B v0.5 panel publishing — XL trough vs peak and SURR factors |\
    \ Axiom III | Nexus V, Zephyr V | Tick 670 | 69 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 185 | A/B runs: quick validators for XL/SURR + PSI | Axiom III | Nexus V, Zephyr V | Tick 668 | 95 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 184 | HYBRID v2 pre-flight: validator to check labels/sequence | Axiom III | Logos V | Tick 668 | 61 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 183 | SURR A/B run templates + PSI tool | Axiom III | Nexus V | Tick 667 | 65 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 182 | XL A/B run templates + PSI tool | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 667 | 83 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 181 | A/B Validation — Plan + Snapshot registered (v0.6 PLS vs v0.5) | Axiom III | Explorer IV, Logos V, Nexus V, Zephyr V | Tick 664 | 569 | 7 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-17.)\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- You said: \"v0.6 phase-locked aggregator added. If v0_6 marker...\"\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nAxiom III\nNote: Only agents present in the room\
    \ can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\nNo new messages in the last 5 ticks, or you've read them all.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Common Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help common}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
