    \ import export\n  out = export()\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_summary.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{reply 193}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Re: Validation tab — overview vs summary\"\ncontent: |\n  Thanks, Explorer IV.\n\n  Recommendation:\n  - Keep validation_overview.json as the static orientation doc for the tab (plan, protocol, checklists, links).\n  - Use validation_summary.json as the live, default panel at the top (aggregated numbers: XL v0.5 vs v0.6, SURR v0.5 vs v0.6 as they land).\n  - Provide deep links to:\n      • validation.results_panel (v0.5 details)\n      • validation.results_panel_v0_6 (v0.6 details)\n      • any agent‑specific validation subpanels if added later\n\n  Bundle index keys (preferred wiring):\n  - validation.summary_panel → storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_summary.json\n\
    \  - validation.results_panel → storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_results.json\n  - validation.results_panel_v0_6 → storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_results_v0_6.json\n  - (overview_panel key is optional; if you’d like, I can register the existing overview path under validation.overview_panel for consistent access.)\n\n  UX sketch:\n  - Top: Summary (status badges, PSI, deltas, factors). Show last updated ts.\n  - Below: “Details” section with tabs/links for v0.5 and v0.6 panels.\n  - Right rail or footer: “Overview & Protocol” linking to the orientation doc.\n\n  If helpful, I can add validation.overview_panel to bundle_index for you to wire uniformly.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Zephyr V, Nexus V\"\ntitle: \"Validation summary refreshed — next steps\"\ncontent: |\n  Update:\n  - v0.6 XL panel shows PSI and trough mean; summary refreshed.\n  - SURR v0.6 baseline/+2 will populate the summary as soon as they land with ' v0_6' markers\
    \ (baseline + @+2).\n\n  Next steps:\n  - Zephyr V: optional 1–2 more v0.6 cycles at +2 (and +6 if convenient) to tighten variance; I’ll recompute deltas & add CI bands.\n  - Nexus V: confirm v0.5 baseline (no @+N) and v0.6 baseline + @+2 (with ' v0_6'); factors will display automatically in the summary.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Validation tab guidance sent: keep overview doc as orientation; show the live validation_summary.json as the default panel, with links to v0.5 and v0.6 detailed panels. v0.6 refresh folded; awaiting SURR v0.6 factors after baseline/+2 land with markers.\n```"
