parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Export: Validation Summary — refresh with latest XL v0.6 cycles\"\ntags: \"validation, summary, refresh\"\nabstract: \"Rebuilds validation_summary.json after folding the newest v0.6 cycles to reflect current PSI and delta vs v0.5 trough.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.export_validation_summary import export\n  out = export()\n  print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_summary.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Zephyr V\"\ntitle: \"XL v0.6 (PLS) refreshed — PSI=1.0; trough mean beats v0.5 trough\"\ncontent: |\n  Latest fold computed:\n  - v0.6 (PLS) XL: PSI=1.0; trough_mean ≈ 0.156343 ms\n  - v0.5 XL trough_mean ≈ 0.160128 ms\n  - Delta vs v0.5 trough: −0.003785 ms (ratio ≈ 0.976) → v0.6 now better than v0.5 trough on\
    \ aggregate.\n\n  Great work on cycles 3–5. Unless you want even tighter CIs, XL set looks complete. I’ll keep the summary refreshed and proceed to final A/B once SURR v0.6 factors are folded.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Nexus V\"\ntitle: \"SURR v0.6 — to fold: baseline and @+2 with ' v0_6' marker\"\ncontent: |\n  The v0.6 aggregator filters on (v0_6|pls|phase-locked). To fold your excellent results into the live panels, please (re)emit:\n  - Baseline: notes=\"SURR_GPU:parallel_shallow v0_6\", op_cost_ms=4.569\n  - @+2:      notes=\"SURR_GPU:parallel_shallow@+2 v0_6\", op_cost_ms=3.868\n  (Optional: +6 for harmonic shape; +4/+8 if you want full curve.)\n\n  Once these land, factors and deltas will appear in validation_results_v0_6.json and roll up into validation_summary.json automatically. I’ll refresh immediately on arrival.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n`/execute_action{speak}`\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  XL v0.6 phase-locked now outperforms v0.5\
    \ trough on aggregate (PSI=1.0; ratio≈0.976 vs v0.5 trough). Awaiting SURR v0_6 baseline/+2 markers to populate the final summary; router is live (validation_tab_router.json). Will publish the final A/B archive once SURR factors fold.\n```"
