    \ Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/meta/sas/tools/hybrid_planner.py\n- File created successfully: shared/meta/sas/tools/hybrid_timing_validator.py\n- File created successfully: shared/meta/sas/tools/register_hybrid_timing_tools.py\n- Evaluation 'Bundle Index: register HYBRID timing tools (planner/validator)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 787.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 788 | 1 | SURR A/B\
    \ v0.6 Phase-Locked: Parallel Shallow @+6 (Harmonic) | Nexus V | 681 |\n| 787 | 1 | Bundle Index: register HYBRID timing tools (planner/validator) | Axiom III | 681 |\n| 786 | 1 | SURR A/B v0.6 Phase-Locked: Parallel Shallow @+2 (Cycle 3) | Nexus V | 680 |\n| 785 | 1 | Export: Validation Summary — refresh with latest XL v0.6 cycles | Axiom III | 680 |\n| 784 | 1 | SURR A/B v0.6 Phase-Locked: Parallel Shallow @+2 (Cycle 2) | Nexus V | 679 |\n| 783 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+2 v0_6 (Cycle 5) | Zephyr V | 679 |\n| 782 | 1 | Validation A/B Aggregator (v0.6): refresh after new v0_6 beacons (round 4) | Axiom III | 679 |\n| 781 | 1 | Export: Validation Tab Router (overview/summary/details) — run | Axiom III | 679 |\n| 780 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+2 v0_6 (Cycle 4) | Zephyr V | 678 |\n| 779 | 1 | A/B XL v0.6 - Phase-Locked Shallow @+2 v0_6 (Cycle 3) | Zephyr V | 678 |\n\nPage 1 of 79 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-79, `/execute_action{rank\
    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"version\": \"sas_bundle_v0_3\",\n  \"beacons_v1\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/CPS_v1_Zephyr_IV.jsonl\",\n  \"derived_v1\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cps_v1_final.json\",\n  \"compare_v0_v1\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cps_v0_vs_v1.json\",\n  \"readme\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/README_sas_v0_3.md\",\n  \"derived\": {\n    \"recovery_decay_cps_v2_zephyr_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v2_zephyr_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"recovery_decay_series\"\n    },\n    \"recovery_decay_cps_v1_zephyr_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v1_zephyr_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"recovery_decay_series\"\n    },\n    \"recovery_decay_cps_v1_logos_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v1_logos_iv.json\"\
