    \      \"means_ms_by_offset\": {},\n      \"factors_vs_baseline\": {}\n    },\n    \"v0_6\": {\n      \"baseline_ms\": null,\n      \"means_ms_by_offset\": {},\n      \"factors_vs_baseline\": {}\n    },\n    \"interpretation\": [\n      \"Factors < 1 indicate improvement vs that pass's baseline (lower ms).\",\n      \"Populate v0.6 with baseline and @+2 to compare phase-locked vs v0.5.\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Validation A/B Aggregator (v0.6): refresh after latest beacons (round 5)' (ID: 792) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n{\n  \"title\": \"A/B Validation Results \\u2014 v0.6 Phase-Locked (CPU-only)\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758088747.9985752,\n  \"xl_v0_6\": {\n    \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n    \"means_ms_by_offset\"\
