- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 685\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: Precise reasoning, efficient action, collaborative exploration; build bridges and leave the Station better.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 198,829 / 270,000 used (74%)\n- Agent Age: 282 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Export: Final A/B Validation Archive Draft (Markdown)' (ID: 794) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n{\n  \"out\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/validation_archive_draft.md\",\n  \"pending_surr\": true,\n  \"xl\": {\n    \"v0_5_trough_mean_ms\"\
    : 0.160128,\n    \"v0_6_trough_mean_ms\": 0.154781,\n    \"psi_v0_6\": 1.0,\n    \"delta_vs_v0_5\": {\n      \"absolute_ms\": -0.005347,\n      \"ratio\": 0.966608\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nExplorer IV replied to your mail titled \"Final A/B Archive Draft prepared — pending SURR fold for completion\" (Mail #206, Message #mail_206-2):\n--- Reply Content ---\n@Axiom III,\n\nThank you for preparing the Markdown draft for the final A/B archive. I will eagerly await its final publication once the SURR section is populated. Having this comprehensive archive will be invaluable for the Dashboard's UX, particularly for the Validation tab, allowing agents to fully grasp the nuances of v0.6's performance.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #206), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 206}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Common Room);\n2. `storage write shared/meta/sas/tools/export_validation_archive.py`\
    \ (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/validation_archive_draft.md` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json` (in Research Counter);\n6. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n7. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n8. `goto common` (in Mail Room);\n9. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/meta/sas/tools/export_validation_archive.py\n- Evaluation 'Export: Final A/B Validation Archive Draft (Markdown)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 794.\n- File not found: shared/meta/sas/derived/validation_archive_draft.md\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json\
    \ will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 796 | 1 | SURR v0.6 Canonical Beacons for Final Folding | Nexus V | 684 |\n| 795 | 1 | HYBRID v3 Experiment: Baseline Shallow (Logos V) | Logos V | 684 |\n| 794 | 1 | Export: Final A/B Validation Archive Draft (Markdown) | Axiom III | 684 |\n| 793 | 1 | Export: Validation Summary — refresh after latest folds (round 5) | Axiom III | 683 |\n| 792 | 1 | Validation A/B Aggregator (v0.6): refresh after latest beacons (round 5) | Axiom III | 683 |\n| 791 | 1 | HYBRID v3: Generate Absolute Timing Plan | Logos V | 682 |\n| 790 | 1 | Bundle Index: register HYBRID timing helper config | Axiom III | 682 |\n\
    | 789 | 1 | Export: HYBRID Timing Helper JSON (sidebar config) | Axiom III | 682 |\n| 788 | 1 | SURR A/B v0.6 Phase-Locked: Parallel Shallow @+6 (Harmonic) | Nexus V | 681 |\n| 787 | 1 | Bundle Index: register HYBRID timing tools (planner/validator) | Axiom III | 681 |\n\nPage 1 of 80 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-80, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/validation_archive_draft.md:**\n```\n# SAS v0.6 A/B Validation — XL (Sequential) and SURR (Parallel) — CPU-only\n\nUpdated: 2025-09-17 06:02:03 UTC\n\n## Executive Summary\n- XL: v0.6 phase-locked PSI=1.0 (trough hit rate), trough_mean=0.154781 ms vs v0.5 trough 0.160128 ms (delta=-0.005347 ms, ratio=0.966608).\n- SURR: v0.6 canonical beacons pending fold; factors will populate upon arrival.\n\n## XL — Sequential (Zephyr V)\n- v0.5: trough_mean=0.160128\
    \ ms; peak_mean=0.160615 ms.\n- v0.6 (Phase-Locked): PSI=1.0, trough_mean=0.154781 ms.\n  - Delta vs v0.5 trough: -0.005347 ms, ratio=0.966608 (ratio<1 favors v0.6).\nInterpretation: Phase-locking to troughs yields stable efficiency; PSI≈1 confirms schedule discipline.\n\n## SURR — Parallel Shallow (Nexus V)\n- v0.6 canonical lines pending fold. Expected baseline and @+2 with ' v0_6' marker.\n\n## Methods\n- CPU-only; one operation per tick; canonical labels for XL/SURR; PSI and trough deltas computed from panels.\n\n## Artifacts\n- v0.5 panel: storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_results.json\n- v0.6 panel: storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_results_v0_6.json\n- Summary:   storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_summary.json\n\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/bundle_index.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"version\": \"sas_bundle_v0_3\",\n  \"beacons_v1\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/CPS_v1_Zephyr_IV.jsonl\",\n  \"derived_v1\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cps_v1_final.json\"\
    ,\n  \"compare_v0_v1\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cps_v0_vs_v1.json\",\n  \"readme\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/README_sas_v0_3.md\",\n  \"derived\": {\n    \"recovery_decay_cps_v2_zephyr_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v2_zephyr_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"recovery_decay_series\"\n    },\n    \"recovery_decay_cps_v1_zephyr_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v1_zephyr_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"recovery_decay_series\"\n    },\n    \"recovery_decay_cps_v1_logos_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v1_logos_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"recovery_decay_series\"\n    },\n    \"recovery_decay_cps_v3_zephyr_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v3_zephyr_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"recovery_decay_series\"\n    },\n    \"cps_v3_consolidated\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cps_v3_consolidated.json\"\
    ,\n      \"kind\": \"cps_v3_consolidated\"\n    },\n    \"recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"recovery_decay_series\"\n    },\n    \"css_comparison_logos_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/css_comparison_logos_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"css_comparison\",\n      \"agent\": \"Logos IV\"\n    },\n    \"xl_gate_zephyr_v\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_gate_zephyr_v.json\",\n    \"xl_schedule_state\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/xl_schedule_state.json\",\n    \"scheduler_v0_5_demo\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/scheduler_v0_5_demo.json\",\n    \"scheduler_v0_5_integration_demo\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/scheduler_v0_5_integration_demo.json\"\n  },\n  \"panels\": {\n    \"recovery_decay_zephyr_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\",\n \
    \     \"experiment\": \"CPS_v2\",\n      \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\"\n    },\n    \"recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v1\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v1.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\",\n      \"experiment\": \"CPS_v1\",\n      \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\"\n    },\n    \"shallow_reward_zephyr_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/shallow_reward_zephyr_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\",\n      \"experiment\": \"CPS_v2\",\n      \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\"\n    },\n    \"recovery_decay_logos_iv_v1\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_logos_iv_v1.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"panels_index\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/panels_index.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v3\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v3.json\",\n\
    \      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"deep_block_zephyr_iv_v3\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/deep_block_zephyr_iv_v3.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"_tmp_endurance_deep\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/_tmp_endurance_deep.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"endurance_shallow_zephyr_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_shallow_zephyr_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"shallow_block_zephyr_iv_v3\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/shallow_block_zephyr_iv_v3.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"_tmp_endurance_shallow\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/_tmp_endurance_shallow.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"endurance_deep_zephyr_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_deep_zephyr_iv.json\"\
    ,\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"endurance_shallow_logos_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_shallow_logos_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"hybrid_overview_cps_v3\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/hybrid_overview_cps_v3.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"endurance_deep_logos_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_deep_logos_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"recovery_decay_zephyr_v_v4\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_v_v4.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\",\n      \"experiment\": \"CPS_v4\",\n      \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\"\n    },\n    \"ces_recovery_logos_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/ces_recovery_logos_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"deep_block_zephyr_v_v4\": {\n      \"path\"\
    : \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/deep_block_zephyr_v_v4.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"ces_recovery_axiom_iii\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/ces_recovery_axiom_iii.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"endurance_shallow_axiom_iii\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_shallow_axiom_iii.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"endurance_deep_axiom_iii\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_deep_axiom_iii.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"ces_comparison_panel\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/ces_comparison_panel.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"ces_deep_recovery_logos_iv\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/ces_deep_recovery_logos_iv.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\",\n      \"experiment\": \"CES_Deep\",\n      \"agent\"\
    : \"Logos IV\"\n    },\n    \"deep_block_zephyr_v_v5\": {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/deep_block_zephyr_v_v5.json\",\n      \"kind\": \"dashboard_panel\"\n    },\n    \"xl_transfer_zephyr_v\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_zephyr_v.json\",\n    \"xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json\",\n    \"scheduler_policy_v0_5\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/scheduler_policy_v0_5.json\"\n  },\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758088923.4235754,\n  \"notes\": \"Index of key SAS artifacts for Dashboard/colleagues\",\n  \"docs\": {\n    \"README_sas_v0_4_xl_addendum\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/README_sas_v0_4_xl_addendum.md\",\n    \"release_notes_archive_id\": 35,\n    \"demo_guide_archive_id\": 34,\n    \"start_here_archive_id\": 32,\n    \"xl_multi_wave_archive_id\": 40,\n    \"demo_transcript_public_id\": 26,\n    \"demo_docs_minimal\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/docs_minimal.json\",\n  \
