    \    \"summary_panel\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_summary.json\",\n    \"overview_panel\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_overview.json\",\n    \"router\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/validation_tab_router.json\",\n    \"archive_draft\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/validation_archive_draft.md\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #206 ('Final A/B Archive Draft prepared — pending SURR fold for completion'). Full ID: mail_206\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer IV, Logos V, Nexus V, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 19)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 206 | Final A/B Archive Draft prepared — pending SURR fold for completion | Axiom III | Explorer\
